Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能放你出去，海德薇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't let you out, Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.37,0:01:18.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在校外不许用魔法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not allowed to use magic outside of school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.37,0:01:23.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再说，要是弗农姨父——哈利·波特！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Besides, if Uncle Vernon-- Harry Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.08,0:01:26.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下你闯祸了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now you've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:34.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在里面。弗农？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's in there. Vernon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:40.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我警告你，你要是管不住那只死鸟，它就得走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm warning you, if you can't control that bloody bird, it'll have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.89,0:01:42.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可它闷得慌啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But she's bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.52,0:01:47.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是我能放它出去一两个钟头就好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I could only let her out for an hour or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.19,0:01:51.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好给你那些古怪的小朋友发秘密消息？不行，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you can send secret messages to your freaky little friends? No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:56.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我一个朋友的消息都没收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I haven't had any messages from any of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:01:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一封都没有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not one...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:00.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……整个暑假。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...all summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.33,0:02:03.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁会想跟你做朋友？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who would want to be friends with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.83,0:02:08.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为你该更懂得感恩一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I should think you'd be a little more grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.42,0:02:11.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们打你小时候就把你养大，把我们桌上的饭给你吃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've raised you since you were a baby, given you the food off our table...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.09,0:02:14.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……还让你住达力的第二间卧室……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...even let you have Dudley's second bedroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:16.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……完全是出于我们心地善良。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...purely out of the goodness of our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.39,0:02:19.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在别动。那是等梅森夫妇来了用的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not now. It's for when the Masons arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:23.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们随时就到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which should be any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.77,0:02:26.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，我们再过一遍安排，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, let's go over our schedule once again, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.77,0:02:28.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}佩妮，梅森夫妇来了，你负责……？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Petunia, when the Masons arrive, you will be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.90,0:02:32.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在客厅，等着亲切地欢迎他们来我们家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the lounge, waiting to welcome them graciously to our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.74,0:02:36.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-很好。达力，你负责……？  -我负责等着开门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good. And, Dudley, you will be...?   -I'll be waiting to open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:38.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:45.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.75,0:02:50.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在卧室里，不出声，假装我不存在。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be in my bedroom, making no noise and pretending that I don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.25,0:02:51.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，你就得这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Too right, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.13,0:02:55.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}运气好的话，今天我就做成这辈子最大的一笔生意……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With any luck, this could be the day I make the biggest deal of my career...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:59.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你别给我搞砸了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and you will not mess it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.48,0:03:15.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利·波特，真是荣幸啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry Potter, such an honor it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.20,0:03:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你是谁？  -多比，先生。家养小精灵多比。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Who are you?   -Dobby, sir. Dobby the house-elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.91,0:03:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是想冒犯您……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to be rude or anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.41,0:03:29.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但现在真不是让家养小精灵待在我卧室的好时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but this isn't a great time for me to have a house-elf in my bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，先生。多比明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir. Dobby understands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:35.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是多比是来告诉您……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just that Dobby has come to tell you....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:40.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这很难开口，先生。多比不知道该从哪儿说起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is difficult, sir. Dobby wonders where to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.47,0:03:46.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你坐下吧？  -坐下？坐下？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why don't you sit down?   -Sit down? Sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:54.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比，对不起。我不是有意冒犯你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby, I'm sorry. I didn't mean to offend you or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.19,0:03:56.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冒犯多比？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Offend Dobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.53,0:03:58.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比听说过您的伟大，先生……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby has heard of your greatness, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:04.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……可从没有巫师请他坐下，像平等的人一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but never has he been asked to sit down by a wizard, like an equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.75,0:04:08.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你肯定没遇到过多少正派的巫师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't have met many decent wizards then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:11.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.17,0:04:13.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这话说得太难听了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was an awful thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.55,0:04:18.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-坏多比！坏多比！  -住手，多比。多比，嘘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bad Dobby! Bad Dobby!   -Stop, Dobby. Dobby, shush.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:19.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比，求你住手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby, please, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.06,0:04:26.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别在意，只是猫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't mind that. It's just the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:33.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-坏多比。  -住手！住手，多比。求你安静点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bad Dobby.   -Stop! Stop, Dobby. Please, be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.36,0:04:35.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.36,0:04:39.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比必须惩罚自己，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby had to punish himself, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.40,0:04:42.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比差点说了主人家的坏话，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby almost spoke ill of his family, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:46.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你的家人？  -多比伺候的巫师家庭，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Your family?   -The wizard family Dobby serves, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比必须永远服侍一个家庭。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby is bound to serve one family forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:52.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是他们知道多比在这儿……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If they ever knew Dobby was here....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:05:00.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可多比必须来。多比要保护哈利·波特，要警告他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Dobby had to come. Dobby has to protect Harry Potter. To warn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:02.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利·波特绝不能回去……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry Potter must not go back...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:07.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……今年绝不能回霍格沃茨魔法学校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:12.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有个阴谋，一个要制造最可怕事件的阴谋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is a plot, a plot to make most terrible things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.90,0:05:16.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么可怕的事？是谁的阴谋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What terrible things? Who's plotting them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.11,0:05:19.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不能说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.07,0:05:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好，我明白。你不能说。  -别逼我说。我——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay, I understand. You can't say.   -Don't make me talk. I--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:30.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-多比。多比，把灯放下。  -坏多比。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Dobby. Dobby, put the lamp down.   -Bad Dobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.62,0:05:34.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以当他们到了第九洞……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So when they arrive at the ninth hole....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把灯给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me the lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:43.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比，住手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:49.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-放开我。  -进去，别出声。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let me go.   -Get in there and keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:53.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你到底在上面干什么？  -我只是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What the devil are you doing up here?   -I was just--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:56.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚毁了我那个日本高尔夫球笑话的包袱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just ruined the punch line of my Japanese golfer joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:05:58.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.82,0:06:03.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再出一点声，你就恨不得自己没出生，小子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One more sound and you'll wish you'd never been born, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:07.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-还有，把门修好。  -是，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-And fix that door.   -Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:11.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白我为什么必须回去了吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See why I've got to go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:15.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不属于这儿。我属于你们的世界，霍格沃茨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't belong here. I belong in your world, at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:20.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那是我唯一有朋友的地方。  -不写信给哈利·波特的朋友？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's the only place I've got friends.   -Friends who don't write to Harry Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:23.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我想他们一直……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I expect they've been....
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:28.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。你怎么知道我朋友没给我写信？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hang on. How do you know my friends haven't been writing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.85,0:06:31.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利·波特别生多比的气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry Potter mustn't be angry with Dobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:36.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比希望，要是哈利·波特以为朋友们忘了他……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby hoped if Harry Potter thought his friends had forgotten him...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:40.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……哈利·波特也许就不想回学校了，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Harry Potter might not want to go back to school, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.03,0:06:45.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-把那些给我。马上。  -不给！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Give me those. Now.   -No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:07:01.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比，回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby, get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:07.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比，求你别。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby, please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.05,0:07:12.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利·波特必须说他不回学校了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry Potter must say he's not going back to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.56,0:07:15.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能。霍格沃茨是我的家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't. Hogwarts is my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.68,0:07:21.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那多比只好自己动手了，先生，为了哈利·波特好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then Dobby must do it, sir, for Harry Potter's own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.44,0:07:26.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它漫得一望无际，铺满了整个地板。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It spread as far as the eye could see, all over the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:28.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个水管工说：“瞧这么多水。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One plumber said, "Look at all that water."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:31.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第二个水管工说：“是啊，这还只是上面一层。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The second plumber said, "Yes, and that's just the top of it."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.63,0:07:39.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}梅森先生……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Mason....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.18,0:07:45.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗农跟我说您高尔夫打得特别好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vernon tells me that you're a wonderful golfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.72,0:07:48.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}偶尔打打。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I play. Occasionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.72,0:07:50.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:52.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}梅森太太……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mrs. Mason...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:55.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……您这么漂亮的西装是在哪儿买的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...where do you get your beautiful suits?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.73,0:07:59.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我所有的西装都是定做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, all of my suits are tailor-made.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.03,0:08:03.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达力……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dudley...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你不是有什么话要说吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...wasn't there something you wanted to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:13.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-布丁。布丁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Pudding. Pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.37,0:08:14.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么布丁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.84,0:08:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真抱歉。是我外甥。他精神很不正常。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so sorry. It's my nephew. He's very disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.05,0:08:29.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他一见生人就紧张。所以我才让他待在楼上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Meeting strangers upsets him. That's why I kept him upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.98,0:08:35.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我们有冰淇淋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, we have ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你再也别想回那所学校了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're never going back to that school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:53.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也再也见不到那些怪胎朋友了。永远别想！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're never going to see those freaky friends of yours again. Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:40.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hiya, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:45.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩。弗雷德。乔治。你们怎么都在这儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron. Fred. George. What are you all doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:49.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然是来救你。快，拿上你的箱子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rescuing you, of course. Now, come on, get your trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:58.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好退后点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You better stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:10:00.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.66,0:10:07.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那是什么？  -怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What was that?   -What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:12.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}波特！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.21,0:10:13.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸，怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:18.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走。快走。快走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go. Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.34,0:10:19.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸，快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:23.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，快，哈利，快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Come on, Harry, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:27.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}佩妮，他要跑了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Petunia, he's escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:30.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我抓到你了，哈利。 -过来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I've got you, Harry.   -Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:33.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放开我！ -不行，小子！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let go of me!   -No, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和那只该死的鸽子哪儿也别想去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You and that bloody pigeon aren't going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:38.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-滚开！  -开车！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Get off!   -Drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:40.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！不！不！不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.46,0:10:48.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.38,0:10:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:06.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}顺便说一句，哈利，生日快乐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the way, Harry, happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.25,0:11:35.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:39.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，来吧。嘘，嘘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, come on. Shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:42.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:52.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说我们吃点行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Think it'd be all right if we had some?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:54.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行，妈妈不会知道的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, Mum will never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不算豪华，但这是家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not much, but it's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:17.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得棒极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think it's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.13,0:12:21.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们去哪儿了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.30,0:12:25.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，见到你太好了，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, how wonderful to see you, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:29.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}床是空的。没留字条。车也没了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beds empty. No note. Car gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.22,0:12:32.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们可能会死。还可能被人看见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could have died. You could have been seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.81,0:12:35.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，我不怪你，哈利，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course, I don't blame you, Harry, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.65,0:12:38.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们饿着他，妈妈。他窗户上还有铁栏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They were starving him, Mum. There were bars on his window.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:43.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你最好祈祷我不会在你窗户上装铁栏，罗纳德·韦斯莱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you best hope I don't put bars on your window, Ronald Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.74,0:12:45.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，哈利，该吃点早餐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Harry, time for a spot of breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:49.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来了，哈利。快吃吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we are, Harry. Now, tuck in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:53.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对了。这就好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-妈妈，你看见我的毛衣了吗？  -看见了，亲爱的，刚才在猫身上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mummy, have you seen my jumper?   -Yes, dear, it was on the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:12:59.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.18,0:13:05.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做什么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:10.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金妮。她整个暑假都在说你。说实话有点烦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ginny. She's been talking about you all summer. A bit annoying, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.48,0:13:13.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-早上好，韦斯莱们。  -早上好，爸爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Morning, Weasleys. Morning, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.02,0:13:17.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚真够忙的。九次突击搜查。 -突击搜查？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What a night. Nine raids.   -Raids?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.23,0:13:21.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸在魔法部工作，在滥用麻瓜物品办公室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad works in the Ministry of Magic, in the Misuse of Muggle Artifacts Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.24,0:13:25.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸喜欢麻瓜，觉得他们特别有意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad loves Muggles, thinks they're fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:27.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:30.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是谁呀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.70,0:13:35.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，抱歉，先生。我是哈利，先生。哈利·波特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, sorry, sir. I'm Harry, sir. Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.71,0:13:38.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天。真的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good Lord. Are you really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.09,0:13:43.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，罗恩跟我们说过你所有的事。他什么时候到的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Ron has told us all about you, of course. When did he get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:45.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天早上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.55,0:13:50.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你儿子们昨晚开着你那辆魔法汽车去了萨里又飞回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your sons flew that enchanted car of yours to Surrey and back last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:54.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？飞得怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you really? How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.27,0:13:59.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说——那真是太不对了，孩子们。你们太不应该了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean-- That was very wrong indeed, boys. Very wrong of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:04.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，哈利，你一定很了解麻瓜吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, Harry, you must know all about Muggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.57,0:14:08.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉我，橡皮鸭到底是干什么用的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me, what exactly is the function of a rubber duck?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.58,0:14:11.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, um....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，应该是埃罗尔送信来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that'll be Errol with the post.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.67,0:14:24.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}珀西，去拿一下好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fetch it, will you, Percy, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:28.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-埃罗尔。它总是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Errol. He's always doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:33.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，看，是我们的霍格沃茨来信。他们也把哈利的寄来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, look, it's our Hogwarts letters. They've sent us Harry's as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.81,0:14:36.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邓布利多一定知道你在这儿。什么都瞒不过他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dumbledore must know you're here. Doesn't miss a trick, that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:38.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不。 -这些可不便宜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, no.   -This lot won't come cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:43.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-光咒语书就很贵。  -我们能应付。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-The spell books alone are expensive. We'll manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:48.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要买齐这些东西，只有一个地方。对角巷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's only one place we're going to get all of this. Diagon Alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:53.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到了，哈利。你先来，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we are, Harry. You go first, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:56.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是哈利从没用飞路粉旅行过，妈妈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Harry's never traveled by Floo powder before, Mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:14:57.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}飞路粉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Floo powder?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:15:02.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩，你先来，让哈利看看怎么用。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You go first, Ron, so that Harry can see how it's done. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.80,0:15:04.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.21,0:15:06.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对角巷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Diagon Alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:21.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看见了吗？很简单的，亲爱的。别害怕。来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see? It's quite easy, dear. Don't be afraid. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.23,0:15:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.65,0:15:27.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进去吧。就这样。小心头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In you go. That's it. Mind your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.99,0:15:31.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对了。现在，拿好你的飞路粉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right. Now, take your Floo powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.99,0:15:35.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样，很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:39.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，别忘了口齿要非常非常清楚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, don't forget to speak very, very clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.75,0:15:44.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对角斜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Diagonally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:53.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他说什么，亲爱的？  -对角斜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What did he say, dear?   -Diagonally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:54.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也觉得是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.71,0:17:15.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么都别碰，德拉科。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't touch anything, Draco.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:17.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，父亲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.06,0:17:35.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马尔福先生，很高兴再次见到您。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Master Malfoy, what a pleasure to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.57,0:17:38.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有小马尔福先生。幸会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And young Master Malfoy too. Delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.11,0:17:42.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得给您看看，今天刚到的，价格很公道——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I must show you, just in today and very reasonably priced--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.32,0:17:44.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我今天不是来买的，博金，我是来卖的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not buying today, Borgin, I'm selling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:47.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-卖？  -德拉科。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Selling?   -Draco.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.75,0:17:53.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}您肯定知道，魔法部……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are aware, no doubt, that the Ministry of Magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:56.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……正在对私人住宅进行更多突击搜查。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...S Conducting more raids on private houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.71,0:17:59.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}甚至有传言说，要出台新的《麻瓜保护法》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's even rumors of a new Muggle Protection Act.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.09,0:18:04.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恐怕纯巫师血统在各处都越来越不值钱了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pure wizard blood is counting for less everywhere, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:06.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我这儿不会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.93,0:18:09.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之，我从家里带了些东西……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, I brought a few items from home...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.85,0:18:14.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些东西要是魔法部来查，咳，可就难堪了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that might prove, ahem, embarrassing were the Ministry to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.98,0:18:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是些毒药之类的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just poisons and the like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:23.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看那个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.78,0:18:27.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那件东西……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That particular item...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.49,0:18:29.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是非卖品。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...1S not for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:31.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:33.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它有独特的品质。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It has unique qualities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:37.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁也不想看它落到坏人手里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One wouldn't want to see it falling into the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.19,0:18:53.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}盒子你留着吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can keep the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.69,0:18:58.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说什么来着？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:02.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么都别碰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Touch nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:05.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-正是。  -对不起，父亲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Exactly.   -Sorry, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:09.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，我们走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.25,0:19:13.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很荣幸和您做生意，马尔福先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a pleasure to do business with you, Mr. Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:16.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}荣幸之至。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Always a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.06,0:19:36.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在找什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Looking for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:38.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.98,0:19:40.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是走错地方了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just in the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.19,0:19:42.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.07,0:19:45.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.25,0:20:06.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你没迷路吧，亲爱的？  -我没事，谢谢。我正要走……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Not lost, are you, my dear?   -I'm fine, thank you. I was just going....
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:11.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我们走吧，我们带你回去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come with us. We'll help you find your way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.77,0:20:14.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不用了，请——海格！哈利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No. Please-- Hagrid! Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:18.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这下面干什么？走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think you're doing down here? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.24,0:20:29.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这一身狼狈，哈利。在翻倒巷鬼鬼祟祟地转悠？那地方不正经。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a mess, Harry. Skulking around Knockturn Alley? Dodgy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:33.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别让人在那儿看见你。人家会以为你要干什么坏事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't want no one to see you there. People will think you're up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:36.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我迷路了，我——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was lost, I--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:39.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。那你在那下面干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hang on. What were you doing down there then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我？我……我在找食肉鼻涕虫驱除剂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me? I was.... I was looking for Flesh-Eating Slug Repellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:47.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们把学校的卷心菜都糟蹋了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're ruining all the school cabbages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:55.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利。海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry. Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:56.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，赫敏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.24,0:20:59.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-见到你太好了。  -见到你我也很高兴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's So good to see you.   -It's great to see you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.49,0:21:03.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的眼镜怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you do to your glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恢复如初。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oculus Reparo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:12.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个咒语我一定得记住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I definitely need to remember that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:16.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你自己没事了吧，哈利？好，那我就不打扰你们了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll be all right now then, Harry? Right. I'll leave you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好，再见。  -谢谢，再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay, bye.   -Thank you. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:20.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，大家都很担心你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, everyone's been so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.77,0:21:31.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.02,0:21:35.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢天谢地。我们还想着你只是多走了一个壁炉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank goodness. We'd hoped you'd only gone one grate too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.44,0:21:38.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们先生们，吉德罗·洛哈特先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies and gentlemen, Mr. Gilderoy Lockhart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.44,0:21:40.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.74,0:21:46.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈迷上他了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mum fancies him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:49.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请让一让。让我过去，夫人。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make way there, please. Let me by, madam. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.96,0:21:53.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，小姑娘。这是给《预言家日报》拍的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, little girl. This is for the Daily Prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.55,0:22:00.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会吧。哈利·波特？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It can't be. Harry Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.97,0:22:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利·波特！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.01,0:22:05.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失陪了，夫人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.26,0:22:11.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}笑一个，哈利。你和我一起准能上头条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice big smile, Harry. Together, you and I rate the front page.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.27,0:22:14.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们先生们，多么难忘的时刻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies and gentlemen, what an extraordinary moment this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天早上小哈利走进丽痕书店……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When young Harry stepped into Flourish and Blotts this morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.15,0:22:22.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……来买我的自传《会魔法的我》……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to purchase my autobiography, Magical Me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.78,0:22:28.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……这本书眼下正庆祝……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...which, incidentally, is currently celebrating...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.83,0:22:33.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……连续第27周雄踞《预言家日报》畅销榜首……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}.Its 27th week atop the Daily Prophet bestseller list...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.83,0:22:38.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……他根本没想到，自己会带着……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...ne had no idea that he would, in fact, be leaving...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:44.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我的全部作品集……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...with my entire collected works...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.01,0:22:47.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……分文不付地离开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...free of charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.35,0:22:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，女士们？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.85,0:22:54.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，把那些给我，我去请他签名。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, now you give me those, and I'll get them signed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.10,0:22:58.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们都在外面等着。就这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All of you wait outside. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.91,0:23:10.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你肯定很享受吧，波特？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll bet you loved that, didn't you, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.58,0:23:15.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大名鼎鼎的哈利·波特。进趟书店都得上头版。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Famous Harry Potter. Can't go into a bookshop without making the front page.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.71,0:23:17.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别烦他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:21.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瞧，波特，你都有女朋友了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, Potter. You've got yourself a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.26,0:23:25.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了好了，德拉科，客气点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, now, Draco, play nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.72,0:23:26.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}波特先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.39,0:23:33.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卢修斯·马尔福。我们终于见面了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lucius Malfoy. We meet at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:35.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恕我无礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.10,0:23:39.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的伤疤可是个传奇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your scar is legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.73,0:23:41.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你留下伤疤的那个巫师自然也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As, of course, is the wizard who gave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.28,0:23:44.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伏地魔杀了我父母。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Voldemort killed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.57,0:23:49.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不过是个杀人犯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was nothing more than a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:53.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你敢提他的名字，一定很勇敢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You must be very brave to mention his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.62,0:23:55.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者很愚蠢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or very foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.42,0:23:59.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}害怕一个名字，只会让你更害怕那个东西本身。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fear of a name only increases fear of the thing itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.50,0:24:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你一定是格兰杰小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you must be Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.64,0:24:11.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，德拉科跟我说过你的事。还有你父母。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, Draco has told me all about you. And your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.60,0:24:20.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是麻瓜，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Muggles, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.98,0:24:28.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我看看。红头发，一脸傻相……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me see. Red hair, vacant expressions...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.49,0:24:32.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……破破烂烂的二手书。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...tatty, secondhand book.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.04,0:24:36.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们一定是韦斯莱家的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You must be the Weasleys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.83,0:24:38.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里太乱了，我们出去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's mad in here. Let's go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.00,0:24:42.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哟，老韦斯莱。 -卢修斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Well, Weasley senior.   -Lucius.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.96,0:24:47.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}部里最近很忙吧，亚瑟，那么多突击搜查？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Busy time at the Ministry, Arthur, all those extra raids?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.80,0:24:50.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但愿他们给你发加班费……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do hope they're paying you overtime...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.30,0:24:53.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……不过看这玩意儿的样子，我猜没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but judging by the state of this, I'd say not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.22,0:24:58.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给巫师这个名号丢脸，又有什么好处……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the use in being a disgrace to the name of wizard...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.14,0:25:01.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……要是连这点钱都挣不到？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...lf they don't even pay you well for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.52,0:25:06.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们对什么叫给巫师丢脸，看法可大不一样，马尔福。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have a very different idea about what disgraces the name of wizard, Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.82,0:25:08.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}显然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.66,0:25:14.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟麻瓜混在一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Associating with Muggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.58,0:25:23.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还以为你们家已经没法更低贱了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I thought your family could sink no lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.50,0:25:29.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}单位见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll see you at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.47,0:25:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}学校见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See you at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.61,0:25:44.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}10点58了，快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}10:58, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.02,0:25:46.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}火车马上就要开了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The train will leave soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.48,0:25:49.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗雷德、乔治、珀西，你们先来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fred, George, Percy, you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.37,0:25:56.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.04,0:26:04.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你先请，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After you, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.92,0:26:10.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，金妮，我们给你找个座位。快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Ginny, we'll get you a seat. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.83,0:26:13.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.59,0:26:30.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你们两个在干什么？  -对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What do you two think you're doing?   -Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.22,0:26:34.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}手推车失控了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lost control of the trolley.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.56,0:26:37.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-为什么我们过不去？  -我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why can't we get through?   -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.06,0:26:41.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}通道不知怎么自己封住了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The gateway has sealed itself for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.77,0:26:46.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}火车11点整发车。我们错过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The train leaves at exactly 11:00. We've missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.90,0:26:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，如果我们过不去……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, if we can't get through...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.57,0:26:53.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……也许爸妈也回不来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... maybe Mum and Dad can't get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.20,0:26:57.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我们该去车那边等着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe we should just go and wait by the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.71,0:27:00.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.22,0:27:09.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.43,0:27:12.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我们要做的就是找到霍格沃茨特快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, all we need to do is find the Hogwarts Express.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.14,0:27:15.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩，你确定会开这玩意儿吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron, are you sure you know how to fly this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.89,0:27:17.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.11,0:27:25.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.40,0:27:27.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.02,0:27:33.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩，我得告诉你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron, I should tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.36,0:27:37.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……大多数麻瓜不习惯看到飞车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...most Muggles aren't accustomed to seeing a flying car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.32,0:27:38.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.74,0:27:39.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.05,0:28:00.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不！隐身助推器一定是坏了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no! The Invisibility Booster must be faulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.80,0:28:03.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就来吧。降低点。我们得找到火车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, then. Let's go lower. We need to find the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.14,0:28:05.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.90,0:28:18.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只要追上火车就行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All we need to do is catch up with the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.53,0:28:20.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不会落后太远。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can't be far behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.20,0:28:24.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你听到了吗？  -我们肯定快到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Do you hear that?   -We must be getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.33,0:28:27.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓紧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.82,0:28:55.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.57,0:29:00.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓紧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.74,0:29:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓住我的手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.54,0:29:11.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓紧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.92,0:29:15.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在努力。你的手全是汗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm trying. Your hand's all sweaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.10,0:29:31.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我想我们找到火车了。  -是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I think we found the train.   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.08,0:29:49.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎回家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.47,0:30:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上去！上去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Up! Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.64,0:30:09.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管用！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.77,0:30:16.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上去！罗恩，当心那棵树！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Up! Ron, mind that tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.61,0:30:21.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停下！停下！停下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop! Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:49.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我的魔杖。看我的魔杖。  -庆幸吧，断的不是你的脖子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-My wand. Look at my wand.   -Be thankful it's not your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.06,0:30:54.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-怎么回事？  -我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's happening?   -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.51,0:31:31.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，走！快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, go! Fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.05,0:32:08.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斑斑，你没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Scabbers, you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.30,0:32:12.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}车！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The car!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.82,0:32:29.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸会杀了我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad's gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.25,0:32:40.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见，海德薇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See you, Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.92,0:32:44.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个家养小精灵出现在我卧室里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So a house-elf shows up in my bedroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.42,0:32:47.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我们过不了9¾站台的通道……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...we Can't get through the barrier to platform 9 3/4...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.55,0:32:50.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我们差点被一棵树砸死……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...we almost get killed by a tree....
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.93,0:32:54.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}显然有人今年不想让我来这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clearly someone doesn't want me here this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.10,0:33:01.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，好好看看吧，小伙子们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, take a good look, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.19,0:33:05.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚很可能就是你们在这座城堡度过的最后一晚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This night might well be the last you spend in this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.94,0:33:11.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪，我们有麻烦了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, dear, we are in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.70,0:33:17.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们被至少七个麻瓜看见了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were seen by no less than seven Muggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.33,0:33:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们知道这有多严重吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have any idea how serious this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.79,0:33:25.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们 jeopard 了暴露我们世界的风险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have risked the exposure of our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.30,0:33:29.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更别提你们给打人柳造成的损伤了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to mention the damage you inflicted on a Whomping Willow...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.38,0:33:32.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……它早在你们出生之前就长在这片地上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that's been on these grounds since before you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.01,0:33:36.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的，斯内普教授，我觉得它给我们造成的伤害更大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, Professor Snape, I think it did more damage to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.76,0:33:37.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闭嘴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.89,0:33:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我向你们保证，如果你们在斯莱特林，命运掌握在我手里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I assure you that were you in Slytherin, and your fate rested with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.48,0:33:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你们俩今晚就会坐上回家的火车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the both of you would be on the train home tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.40,0:33:53.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-而事实上——他们没有。  -他们不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-As it is-- They are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.87,0:33:59.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邓布利多教授。麦格教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor Dumbledore. Professor McGonagall.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.33,0:34:01.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}校长……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Headmaster...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.00,0:34:06.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……这两个男孩违反了《未成年巫师限制条例》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...these boys have flouted the Decree for the Restriction of Underage Wizardry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.92,0:34:10.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-因此——-我很清楚我们的规章……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-As such-- -I am well aware of our bylaws...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.01,0:34:13.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……其中不少还是我亲手写的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...having written quite a few of them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.26,0:34:17.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过，作为格兰芬多学院的院长……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}However, as head of Gryffindor house...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.68,0:34:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……应该由麦格教授来决定合适的处分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}.. it is for Professor McGonagall to determine the appropriate action.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.14,0:34:25.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我们去拿东西吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll go and get our stuff, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.44,0:34:27.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么，韦斯莱先生？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you talking about, Mr. Weasley?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.06,0:34:30.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们要开除我们，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're going to expel us, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.86,0:34:34.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是今天，韦斯莱先生……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not today, Mr. Weasley...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.16,0:34:40.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但我必须让你们俩明白你们所做的事有多严重。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but I must impress on both of you the seriousness of what you have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.70,0:34:45.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚我会写信给你们家里，你们俩都要关禁闭。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will be writing to your families tonight, and you will both receive detention.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.68,0:34:50.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我建议我们都回去继续参加晚宴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now I suggest that we all return to the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.85,0:34:55.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一块看起来很美味的蛋奶果挞，我特别想尝尝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is a delicious-looking custard tart that I am most anxious to sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.29,0:35:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}费尔奇先生，你掉了这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Filch, you dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.95,0:35:47.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家早上好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Morning, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.07,0:35:50.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-大家早上好。  -早上好，斯普劳特教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good morning, everyone.   -Good morning, Professor Sprout.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.83,0:35:55.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎来到第三温室，二年级同学。大家围过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to Greenhouse Three, second years. Gather around, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.25,0:35:58.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天我们要给曼德拉草换盆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Today we're going to re-pot Mandrakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.25,0:36:01.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁能告诉我曼德拉草根的特性？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who here can tell me the properties of the Mandrake root?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.43,0:36:04.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，格兰杰小姐？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, Miss Granger?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.43,0:36:06.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}曼德拉草，又叫曼陀罗草……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mandrake, or Mandragora...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.94,0:36:11.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……能使被石化的人恢复原状。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...iS used to return those who have been Petrified to their original state.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.06,0:36:17.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它也很危险。曼德拉草的哭声对听到的人来说是致命的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's also dangerous. The Mandrake's cry is fatal to anyone who hears it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.24,0:36:20.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常好。格兰芬多加十分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excellent. Ten points to Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.24,0:36:22.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我们的曼德拉草还是幼苗……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As our Mandrakes are still only seedlings...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.12,0:36:24.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……它们的哭声还不会要你们的命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...their cries won't kill you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.16,0:36:29.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但能让你们昏迷好几个小时，所以我给你们发了耳罩……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But they could knock you out for hours, which is why I have given you earmuffs...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.16,0:36:30.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……用来保护听觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...for auditory protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.83,0:36:35.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以请你们马上戴上，快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So could you please put them on, right away? Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.46,0:36:38.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}耳罩要捂紧，仔细看我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Flaps tight down, and watch me closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.38,0:36:41.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}牢牢抓住你的曼德拉草。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You grasp your Mandrake firmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.55,0:36:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}猛地把它从盆里拔出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You pull it sharply up out of the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.85,0:36:50.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白了吗？然后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got it? And...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.98,0:36:53.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……现在把它塞进另一个盆里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...now you dunk it down into the other pot...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.23,0:36:57.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……再撒一点土，让它暖和些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and pour a little sprinkling of soil to keep him warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.57,0:37:04.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}隆巴顿又没戴耳罩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Longbottom's been neglecting his earmuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.20,0:37:09.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不，教授，他只是晕过去了。  -好吧，就把他留在那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, ma'am, he's just fainted.   -Yes, well, just leave him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.62,0:37:13.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我们继续。花盆多得是，人人有份。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right, on we go. Plenty of pots to go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.38,0:37:16.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓住曼德拉草，把它拔出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grasp your Mandrake and pull it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.89,0:37:35.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是差点没头的尼克。-你好，珀西，克里尔沃特小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-There's Nearly Headless Nick.   -Hello, Percy, Miss Clearwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.82,0:37:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，尼古拉斯爵士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Sir Nicholas.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.83,0:37:53.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说吧。我完蛋了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say it. I'm doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.96,0:37:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你完蛋了。嗨，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're doomed. Hi, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.13,0:38:00.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是科林·克里维。我也是格兰芬多的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Colin Creevey. I'm in Gryffindor too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.05,0:38:02.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，科林。很高兴认识你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Colin. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.84,0:38:06.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说，你觉得你这位朋友能给我和你拍张照吗……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say, do you think your friend here could take a photo of me and you...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.55,0:38:09.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……拍我们站在一起？好证明我见过你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... Standing together? To prove I've met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.39,0:38:11.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是给我爸的。你知道吗，他是送牛奶的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's for my dad. He's a milkman, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.60,0:38:13.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个麻瓜，我们家在我之前都是麻瓜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A Muggle, like all our family's been until me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.06,0:38:17.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在收到霍格沃茨的信之前，没人知道我会的那些东西是魔法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one knew the stuff I could do was magic till we got letters from Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.02,0:38:21.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-大家都以为我脑子有毛病。  -真想不到啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Everyone just thought I was mental.   -Ilmagine that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.88,0:38:24.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩，那是你的猫头鹰吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron, is that your owl?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.48,0:38:42.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这该死的鸟真是个祸害。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bloody bird's a menace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.32,0:38:47.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.99,0:38:51.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家快看。韦斯莱收到一封吼叫信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, everyone. Weasley's got himself a Howler.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.91,0:38:58.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打开吧，罗恩。我有一次没理我奶奶寄来的吼叫信。太可怕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on, Ron. I ignored one from my gran once. It was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.34,0:39:07.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗纳德·韦斯莱！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ronald Weasley!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.84,0:39:15.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你竟敢偷那辆车！我真是恶心透了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How dare you steal that car! I am absolutely disgusted!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.23,0:39:18.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爸爸现在在单位要接受调查……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your father's now facing an inquiry at work...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.02,0:39:21.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……这全是你的错！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..and it's entirely your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.86,0:39:25.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是再敢乱来一步……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you put another toe out of line...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.86,0:39:29.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我们就立刻把你接回家！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...we'll bring you straight home!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.91,0:39:33.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，亲爱的金妮，恭喜你进了格兰芬多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, Ginny, dear, congratulations on making Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.58,0:39:37.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爸爸和我都为你骄傲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your father and I are so proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.56,0:40:01.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我来介绍你们的新黑魔法防御术老师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me introduce you to your new Defense Against the Dark Arts teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.15,0:40:03.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.90,0:40:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吉德罗·洛哈特……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gilderoy Lockhart...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.57,0:40:09.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……梅林勋章三级……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Order of Merlin, Third Class...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.07,0:40:13.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……黑魔法防御联盟荣誉会员……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... honorary member of the Dark Force Defense League...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.57,0:40:16.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……五次获得……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and five times winner...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.79,0:40:22.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……《女巫周刊》最迷人微笑奖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...of Witch Weekly's Most-Charming-Smile Award.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.08,0:40:24.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我可不会到处说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I don't talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.75,0:40:29.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不是靠对班登女妖微笑才把她赶走的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't get rid of the Bandon Banshee by smiling at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.68,0:40:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看你买了我全套的书。干得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see you've bought a complete set of my books. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.73,0:40:40.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天我们先来个小测验。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, I thought we'd start today with a little quiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.23,0:40:46.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么好担心的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.24,0:40:49.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是看看你们读得怎么样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just to check how well you've read them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.03,0:40:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.78,0:40:56.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看你们记住了多少。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How much you've taken in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.63,0:41:04.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看这些问题。全都是关于他的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at these questions. They're all about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.80,0:41:07.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“吉德罗·洛哈特最喜欢的颜色是什么？”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"What is Gilderoy Lockhart's favorite color?"
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.80,0:41:13.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“吉德罗·洛哈特迄今为止最伟大的成就是什么？”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"What is Gilderoy Lockhart's greatest achievement to date?"
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.77,0:41:18.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们有三十分钟。开始……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have 30 minutes. Start...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.48,0:41:23.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……现在！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...now!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.20,0:41:31.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啧啧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tut-tut.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.07,0:41:36.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几乎没人记得我最喜欢的颜色是丁香紫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hardly any of you remembered that my favorite color is lilac.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.49,0:41:38.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过赫敏·格兰杰小姐……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Miss Hermione Granger...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.96,0:41:43.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……知道我的秘密抱负是清除世上的邪恶……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...knew that my secret ambition is to rid the world of evil...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.50,0:41:47.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……并推销我自己品牌的护发药水。好姑娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and market my own range of hair-care potions. Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.17,0:41:51.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，你们要当心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, be warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.68,0:41:53.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的职责就是武装你们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is my job to arm you...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.93,0:41:59.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……对抗巫师界已知的最邪恶生物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...against the foulest creatures known to wizardkind.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.06,0:42:03.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这间教室里，你们可能会面对自己最深的恐惧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You may find yourselves facing your worst fears in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.81,0:42:07.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要你们知道，有我在，你们不会受到任何伤害。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Know only that no harm can befall you whilst I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.03,0:42:10.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得请你们不要尖叫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I must ask you not to scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.15,0:42:13.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那可能会激怒它们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It might provoke them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.16,0:42:18.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}康沃尔郡小精灵？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cornish pixies?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.87,0:42:21.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚抓到的康沃尔郡小精灵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Freshly caught Cornish pixies.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.71,0:42:24.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想笑就笑吧，斐尼甘先生……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Laugh if you will, Mr. Finnegan...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.00,0:42:29.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但小精灵可是非常狡猾的小坏东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but pixies can be devilishly tricky little blighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.34,0:42:32.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看你们怎么对付它们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's see what you make of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.60,0:42:39.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，把它们赶拢。它们不过是小精灵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on now, round them up. They're only pixies.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.61,0:42:59.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就待在那儿！求你了，把我弄下来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just stay there! Please, get me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.08,0:43:04.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放开我！-别动，保持不动！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Get off me!   -Stop. Hold still!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.21,0:43:09.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}佩斯基皮克西·佩斯特诺米！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Peskipiksi Pesternomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.40,0:43:33.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就请你们三个把剩下的几只赶紧弄回笼子里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll ask you three to just nip the rest of them back into their cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.41,0:43:37.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们现在怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.07,0:43:40.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}统统定住！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Immobulus!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.09,0:43:52.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么总是我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why is it always me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.76,0:44:01.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我整个夏天都在设计一套全新的魁地奇训练计划。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I spent the summer devising a whole new Quidditch program.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.68,0:44:05.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要练得更早、更苦、更久。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna train earlier, harder and longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.47,0:44:08.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么……？真不敢相信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What--? I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.56,0:44:14.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-弗林特，你以为你要去哪儿？  -魁地奇训练。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where you think you're going, Flint?   -Quidditch practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.44,0:44:18.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我今天给格兰芬多订了球场。  -别急，伍德。我有批条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I booked the pitch for Gryffindor today.   -Easy, Wood. I've got a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.24,0:44:22.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀。我闻到麻烦的味道了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh-oh. I smell trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.08,0:44:26.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“我，西弗勒斯·斯内普教授，特此允许斯莱特林队……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"I, Professor Severus Snape, do hereby give the Slytherin team...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.75,0:44:30.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……今日进行训练，因为他们需要训练新找球手。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...permission to practice today, owing to the need to train their new Seeker."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.42,0:44:33.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们有新找球手了。谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got a new Seeker. Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.09,0:44:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-马尔福？  -没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Malfoy?   -That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.84,0:44:42.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今年新的可不只这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that's not all that's new this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.47,0:44:46.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些是光轮2001。你们怎么弄到的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Those are Nimbus 2001s. How did you get those?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.10,0:44:49.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德拉科的父亲送的礼物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A gift from Draco's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.31,0:44:53.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，韦斯莱，不像某些人，我父亲买得起最好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see, Weasley, unlike some, my father can afford the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.27,0:44:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少格兰芬多队没人得靠花钱进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least no one on the Gryffindor team had to buy their way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.44,0:44:59.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们全靠实力进来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They got in on pure talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.53,0:45:06.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人问你的意见，你这个肮脏的小泥巴种。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one asked your opinion, you filthy little Mudblood.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.95,0:45:12.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会为这句话付出代价的，马尔福。吃鼻涕虫！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll pay for that one, Malfoy. Eat slugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.96,0:45:21.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧，罗恩？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You okay, Ron?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.80,0:45:26.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说句话啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.85,0:45:37.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哇！哈利，你能把他转过来吗？  -不，科林，让开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Wow! Can you turn him around, Harry? No, Colin, get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.32,0:45:40.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们带他去海格那儿吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's take him to Hagrid's.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.49,0:45:42.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他知道该怎么办。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He'll know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.50,0:45:54.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这得用专业设备。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This calls for a specialist's equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.67,0:46:02.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恐怕只能等它自己停了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing to do but wait till it stops, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.88,0:46:06.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好吧。  -吐出来总比留在里面好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay.   -Better out than in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.68,0:46:12.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-罗恩到底想咒谁？  -马尔福。他骂了赫敏……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Who was Ron trying to curse, anyway?   -Malfoy. He called Hermione....
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.18,0:46:16.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不知道那具体是什么意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I don't know exactly what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.57,0:46:22.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他叫我泥巴种。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He called me a Mudblood.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.94,0:46:25.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他没有。  -泥巴种是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He did not.   -What's a Mudblood?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.03,0:46:30.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}意思是“肮脏的血”。泥巴种是对麻瓜出身的人的一种恶毒称呼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It means "dirty blood." Mudblood's a foul name for someone who's Muggle-born.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.70,0:46:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是父母不会魔法的人。像我这样的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone with non-magic parents. Someone like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.46,0:46:39.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种词在文明人的交谈里可听不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not a term one usually hears in civilized conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.76,0:46:45.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}问题是，哈利，有些巫师，比如马尔福家族……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See, the thing is, Harry, there are some wizards, like the Malfoy family...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.72,0:46:50.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……觉得自己是纯血统就高人一等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...who think they're better than everyone else because they're pure-blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.56,0:46:52.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太可怕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.23,0:46:56.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真恶心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.73,0:47:00.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且根本是胡说八道。肮脏的血。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it's codswallop to boot. Dirty blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.40,0:47:03.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如今活着的巫师，哪个不是混血或者更差。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why, there isn't a wizard alive today that's not half-blood or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.90,0:47:08.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更重要的是，还没有哪道咒语是我们的赫敏不会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More to the point, they've yet to think of a spell that our Hermione can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.62,0:47:10.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.95,0:47:18.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别往心里去，赫敏。一分钟都别想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you think on it, Hermione. Don't you think on it for one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.96,0:47:20.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aye?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.18,0:47:29.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，哈利，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, Harry, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.43,0:47:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能想象吗……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you possibly imagine...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.81,0:47:35.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……还有什么比这更好的关禁闭方式……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...a better way to serve detention...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.64,0:47:38.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……就是帮我回粉丝来信？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...than by helping me to answer my fan mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.52,0:47:39.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还真想不出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.10,0:47:46.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}名气是个靠不住的朋友，哈利。名人就得有名人的样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fame is a fickle friend, Harry. Celebrity is as celebrity does.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.65,0:47:48.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住这点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.33,0:47:54.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.66,0:47:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.04,0:48:00.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……到我这儿来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.21,0:48:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么？  -你说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.01,0:48:10.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个声音。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.14,0:48:12.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}声音？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.22,0:48:20.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你没听见吗？  -你在说什么，哈利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Didn't you hear it?   -What are you talking about, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.48,0:48:25.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看你是有点犯困了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you're getting a bit drowsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.23,0:48:29.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，也难怪。看看时间。我们在这儿快四个小时了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And great Scott, no wonder. Look at the time. We've been here nearly four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.66,0:48:32.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玩得开心时时间过得飞快，真够诡异的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Spooky how the time flies when one is having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.00,0:48:40.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}诡异。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Spooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.54,0:48:45.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}血。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.84,0:48:49.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我闻到血的味道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I smell blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.55,0:48:52.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我撕碎你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me rip you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.84,0:48:56.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我杀了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.22,0:48:59.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杀！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.60,0:49:01.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杀！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.69,0:49:04.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-杀！  -哈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Kill!   -Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.73,0:49:07.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听见了吗？ -听见什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Did you hear it?   -Hear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.40,0:49:10.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那个声音。  -声音？什么声音？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That voice.   -Voice? What voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.03,0:49:14.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我第一次是在洛哈特的办公室听见的。然后刚刚又——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I heard it first in Lockhart's office. And then again just--
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.24,0:49:17.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}时候到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.54,0:49:20.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它在移动。我觉得它要杀人了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's moving. I think it's going to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.71,0:49:25.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杀人？哈利，等等！别跑那么快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kill? Harry, wait! Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.24,0:49:53.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奇怪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.78,0:49:58.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我从没见过蜘蛛这样。  -我不喜欢蜘蛛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I've never seen spiders act like that.   -I don't like spiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.41,0:50:04.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.92,0:50:10.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“密室已被打开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"The Chamber of Secrets has been opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.63,0:50:12.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继承人的敌人，当心。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Enemies of the Heir, beware."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.63,0:50:14.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是用血写的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's written in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.80,0:50:19.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.69,0:50:26.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是费尔奇的猫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Filch's cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.48,0:50:29.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是洛丽丝夫人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Mrs. Norris.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.83,0:50:48.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“继承人的敌人，当心。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Enemies of the Heir, beware."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.09,0:50:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下一个就是你们，泥巴种。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll be next, Mudbloods.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.63,0:50:57.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里怎么回事？走开。让开，让开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on here? Go on. Make way, make way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.22,0:51:01.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}波特？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.22,0:51:03.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们在……？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.69,0:51:08.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}洛丽丝夫人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mrs. Norris?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.48,0:51:14.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你杀了我的猫。  -不。不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You've murdered my cat.   -No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.03,0:51:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要杀了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.66,0:51:21.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我要杀了你！阿格斯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'Il kill you! Argus!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.87,0:51:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿格斯，我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Argus, l....
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.04,0:51:31.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有人立刻回宿舍去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone will proceed to their dormitories immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.38,0:51:34.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone except...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.17,0:51:37.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你们三个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.51,0:51:42.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉文克劳的，跟我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ravenclaws, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.18,0:51:48.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她没死，阿格斯。她被石化了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's not dead, Argus. She has been Petrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.19,0:51:51.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，我就知道。真不巧我当时不在场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah. Thought so. So unlucky I wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.19,0:51:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我正好知道能救她的破解咒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know exactly the countercurse that could've spared her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.74,0:51:59.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但她是怎样被石化的，我说不上来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But how she has been Petrified, I cannot say.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.66,0:52:02.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}问他。就是他干的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ask him. It's him that's done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.53,0:52:05.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看见他在墙上写的字了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You saw what he wrote on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.37,0:52:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是真的，先生。我发誓。我从没碰过洛丽丝夫人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not true, sir. I swear. I never touched Mrs. Norris.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.67,0:52:14.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-胡说。  -校长，我可以说一句吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Rubbish.   -If I might, headmaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.55,0:52:19.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许波特和他的朋友只是碰巧在错误的时间到了错误的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perhaps Potter and his friends were just in the wrong place at the wrong time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.88,0:52:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}However...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.10,0:52:25.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……情况很可疑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the circumstances are suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.22,0:52:29.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少我不记得晚餐时见过波特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I, for one, don't recall seeing Potter at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.06,0:52:32.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那恐怕是我的安排，西弗勒斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm afraid that's my doing, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.44,0:52:35.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，哈利在帮我回粉丝来信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see, Harry was helping me answer my fan mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.07,0:52:39.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我们才去找他，教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why Ron and I went looking for him, professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.49,0:52:42.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们刚找到他，他就说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'd just found him when he said....
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.49,0:52:48.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么事，格兰杰小姐？  -我说我不饿的时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes, Miss Granger?   -When I said I wasn't hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.75,0:52:53.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们正回公共休息室，就发现了洛丽丝夫人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We were heading back to the common room when we found Mrs. Norris.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.09,0:53:01.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-在证明有罪之前都是无辜的，西弗勒斯。  -我的猫被石化了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Innocent until proven guilty, Severus. My cat has been Petrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.43,0:53:08.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我要看到惩罚！  -我们能治好她的，阿格斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I want to see some punishment!   -We will be able to cure her, Argus.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.23,0:53:13.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}据我所知，斯普劳特教授的曼德拉草长得很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As I understand it, Madam Sprout has a very healthy growth of Mandrake.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.15,0:53:18.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等它们成熟，就能配出药剂让洛丽丝夫人复活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When matured, a potion will be made which will revive Mrs. Norris.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.94,0:53:20.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这期间……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And in the meantime...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.16,0:53:25.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我强烈建议大家……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I strongly recommend caution...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.83,0:53:27.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……都要小心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...tO all.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.84,0:53:42.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有点奇怪，不是吗？ -奇怪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's a bit strange, isn't it?   -Strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.47,0:53:45.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听到这个声音，一个只有你能听到的声音……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You hear this voice, a voice only you can hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.39,0:53:50.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……然后洛丽丝夫人就被石化了。就是很奇怪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..and then Mrs. Norris turns up Petrified. It's just strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.31,0:53:53.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得我该告诉他们吗？我是说邓布利多他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think I should have told them? Dumbledore and the others, I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.69,0:53:55.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你疯了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.31,0:54:00.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，哈利。即使在魔法世界，听到声音也不是好兆头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Harry. Even in the wizarding world, hearing voices isn't a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.90,0:54:05.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.66,0:54:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请大家注意一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could I have your attention, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.50,0:54:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。今天我们要把动物……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Now, today, we will be transforming animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.17,0:54:20.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……变成高脚水杯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Into water goblets.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.51,0:54:23.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like so.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.34,0:54:28.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一、二、三。维拉维托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One, two, three. Vera Verto.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.81,0:54:35.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在轮到你们了。谁想先来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now it's your turn. Who would like to go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.31,0:54:41.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}韦斯莱先生。一、二、三。维拉维托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Weasley. "One, two, three. Vera Verto."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.86,0:54:46.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}维拉维托！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vera Verto!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.04,0:54:55.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那根魔杖该换了，韦斯莱先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That wand needs replacing, Mr. Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.04,0:54:59.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是，格兰杰小姐？——教授……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes, Miss Granger?   -Professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.38,0:55:03.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我想问您能不能给我们讲讲密室的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I was wondering if you could tell us about the Chamber of Secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.76,0:55:11.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.56,0:55:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们当然都知道……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You all know, of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.73,0:55:18.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……霍格沃茨是一千多年前……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that Hogwarts was founded over a thousand years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.73,0:55:23.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……由当时最伟大的四位巫师创立的：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...by the four greatest witches and wizards of the age:
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.36,0:55:27.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}戈德里克·格兰芬多、赫尔加·赫奇帕奇……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Godric Gryffindor, Helga Hufflepuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.24,0:55:32.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……罗伊娜·拉文克劳和萨拉查·斯莱特林。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Rowena Ravenclaw and Salazar Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.58,0:55:39.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}四位创始人中有三位相处得十分和睦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, three of the founders coexisted quite harmoniously.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.75,0:55:42.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一位不是。——不用猜都知道是谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-One did not.   -Three guesses who.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.46,0:55:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}萨拉查·斯莱特林希望更严格地挑选……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Salazar Slytherin wished to be more selective...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.09,0:55:49.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……霍格沃茨录取的学生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...about the students admitted to Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.43,0:55:54.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他认为魔法教育应该只保留在纯魔法家庭中。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He believed magical learning should be kept within all-magic families.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.18,0:55:56.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}换句话说，就是纯血统。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In other words, pure-bloods.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.68,0:56:02.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他无法说服其他人，便决定离开学校。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unable to sway the others, he decided to leave the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.90,0:56:05.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}据传说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, according to legend...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.28,0:56:08.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……斯莱特林在这座城堡里建了一个隐秘的房间……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...olytherin had built a hidden chamber in this castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.16,0:56:12.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……被称为密室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...kKnown as the Chamber of Secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.99,0:56:17.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过在离开前不久，他把密室封了起来……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Though, shortly before departing, he sealed it...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.62,0:56:21.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……直到他真正的继承者回到学校的那一天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...until that time when his own true Heir returned to the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.92,0:56:24.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有继承者……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Heir alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.46,0:56:27.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……才能打开密室……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...would be able to open the Chamber...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.30,0:56:32.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……放出里面的恐怖之物，借此……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..and unleash the horror within, and by so doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.18,0:56:35.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……清除学校里所有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...purge the school of all those who...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.72,0:56:40.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……在斯莱特林看来不配学习魔法的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..in Slytherin's view, were unworthy to study magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.36,0:56:43.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麻瓜出身的巫师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Muggle-borns.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.52,0:56:48.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自然，学校被搜查过很多次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Naturally, the school has been searched many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.32,0:56:51.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从未找到这样的密室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No such chamber has been found.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.37,0:56:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教授？传说密室里到底有什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor? What exactly does legend tell us lies within the Chamber?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.87,0:57:00.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}据说密室里住着某种……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Chamber is said to be home to something...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.66,0:57:04.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……只有斯莱特林的继承者才能控制的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that only the Heir of Slytherin can control.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.84,0:57:08.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}据说那是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is said to be the home...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.67,0:57:10.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……一只怪物的巢穴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...of a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.01,0:57:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得是真的吗？你觉得真的有密室吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think it's true? Do you think there really is a Chamber of Secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.85,0:57:24.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的。你没看出来吗？麦格很担心。所有老师都是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Couldn't you tell? McGonagall's worried. All the teachers are.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.23,0:57:28.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果真有密室，而且已经被打开了，那说明——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If there really is a Chamber of Secrets, and it has been opened, that means--
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.24,0:57:32.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯莱特林的继承者回到了霍格沃茨。问题是，是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Heir of Slytherin has returned to Hogwarts. The question is, who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.36,0:57:36.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想想看。我们认识谁认为麻瓜出身的都是渣滓？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's think. Who do we know who thinks all Muggle-borns are scum?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.91,0:57:39.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你说的是马尔福——当然。你听到他说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-If you're talking about Malfoy-- -Of course. You heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.75,0:57:41.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“下一个就是你们，泥巴种。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"You'll be next, Mudbloods."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.62,0:57:44.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听到了。可马尔福，是斯莱特林的继承者？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I heard him. But Malfoy, the Heir of Slytherin?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.42,0:57:47.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许罗恩说得对，赫敏。看看他的家族。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe Ron's right, Hermione. I mean, look at his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.75,0:57:50.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们全家几百年都在斯莱特林。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The whole lot of them have been in Slytherin for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.72,0:57:54.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克拉布和高尔肯定知道。也许我们能骗他们说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crabbe and Goyle must know. Maybe we could trick them into telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.59,0:57:58.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们再笨也不会上当。不过也许还有别的办法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even they aren't that thick. But there might be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.93,0:58:00.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过，那会很困难。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mind you, it would be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.93,0:58:03.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更别说我们会违反大约50条校规……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to mention we'd be breaking about 50 school rules...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.15,0:58:08.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……而且会很危险。非常危险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and it'll be dangerous. Very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.45,0:58:17.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这个。复方汤剂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here it is. The Polyjuice Potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.08,0:58:20.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“若熬制得当，复方汤剂能让饮用者……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Properly brewed, the Polyjuice Potion allows the drinker...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.95,0:58:25.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……暂时变成另一个人的模样。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to transform himself temporarily into the physical form of another."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.42,0:58:29.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是说如果哈利和我喝了那玩意，就会变成克拉布和高尔？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You mean if Harry and I drink that stuff, we'll turn into Crabbe and Goyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.34,0:58:32.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了！马尔福什么都会告诉我们。——正是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Wicked! Malfoy will tell us anything.   -Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.92,0:58:36.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这很难。我从没见过更复杂的魔药。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it's tricky. I've never seen a more complicated potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.93,0:58:40.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要多久才能做好？——一个月。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How long will it take to make?   -A month.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.43,0:58:41.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个月？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A month?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.06,0:58:45.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是赫敏，如果马尔福是斯莱特林的继承者……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, Hermione, if Malfoy is the Heir of Slytherin...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.06,0:58:49.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……到那时他可能已经袭击了学校一半麻瓜出身的巫师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...e could attack half the Muggle-borns in the school by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.44,0:58:51.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.48,0:58:54.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这是我们唯一的计划。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it's the only plan we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.00,0:59:46.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯莱特林又进一球！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Another goal for Slytherin!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.17,0:59:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们90比30领先格兰芬多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They lead Gryffindor 90 to 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.63,0:59:56.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好耶！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.45,1:00:22.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还好吗，疤头？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right there, Scarhead?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.92,1:00:31.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心，哈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch yourself, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.79,1:00:33.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伍德，当心！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wood, look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.89,1:01:09.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪！哈利遇上失控的游走球了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Blimey! Harry's got himself a rogue Bludger.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.89,1:01:11.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那球被人动过手脚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's been tampered with, that has.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.69,1:01:13.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去拦住它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.90,1:01:18.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行！就算用正常的魔杖也太冒险了。你可能会打中哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! Even with a proper wand, it's too risky. You could hit Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.55,1:01:46.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在练芭蕾吗，波特？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Training for the ballet, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.13,1:02:19.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你永远抓不到我，波特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll never catch me, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.18,1:03:51.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.39,1:03:56.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利·波特抓住了飞贼。格兰芬多获胜！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry Potter has caught the Snitch. Gryffindor wins!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.90,1:04:04.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咒立停！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Finite Incantatem!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.03,1:04:13.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Thank you. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.54,1:04:15.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有事。我想我的手臂断了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I think my arm is broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.79,1:04:18.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心。我马上就把你的手臂治好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to worry. I will fix that arm of yours straightaway.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.50,1:04:22.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。不要你治。——这孩子不知道自己在说什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No. Not you.   -Boy doesn't know what he's saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.88,1:04:26.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一点都不疼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This won't hurt a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.55,1:04:35.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}骨骼修复！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brackium Emendo!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.56,1:04:46.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，这有时会发生……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, well, that can sometimes happen...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.82,1:04:49.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但重点是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but the point is...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.45,1:04:54.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你不再感到疼痛了，而且很明显，骨头没有断。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you can no longer feel any pain, and, very clearly, the bones are not broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.74,1:04:57.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}断了？骨头都没了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Broken? There's no bones left.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.12,1:05:01.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过灵活多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Much more flexible, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.58,1:05:07.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马尔福先生，别大惊小怪。你可以走了。让开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Malfoy, stop making such a fuss. You can go. Out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.63,1:05:09.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}应该直接送到我这里来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Should have been brought straight to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.76,1:05:12.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能瞬间把骨头接好，但让骨头长回来……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can mend bones in a heartbeat, but growing them back....
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.47,1:05:13.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能做到的，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You will be able to, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.14,1:05:17.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当然能。不过会很疼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be able to, certainly. But it'll be painful.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.93,1:05:22.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}波特，你今晚可不好过。让骨头重新长出来可不是好受的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're in for a rough night, Potter. Regrowing bones is a nasty business.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.48,1:05:28.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还指望什么？南瓜汁吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you expect? Pumpkin juice?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.12,1:05:36.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.70,1:05:39.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.63,1:05:47.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该杀人了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.97,1:05:55.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.80,1:05:57.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.01,1:06:00.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利·波特本该听多比的话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry Potter should have listened to Dobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.81,1:06:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利·波特错过火车时就该回家的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry Potter should have gone back home when he missed the train.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.69,1:06:09.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你。是你让屏障不放我和罗恩过去的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was you. You stopped the barrier from letting Ron and me through.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.65,1:06:12.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。是的，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Indeed. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.61,1:06:18.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你差点害我和罗恩被开除。  -至少你们就能离开这里了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You nearly got Ron and me expelled.   -At least you would be away from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.83,1:06:21.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利·波特必须回家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry Potter must go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.66,1:06:25.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比以为他的游走球足以让哈利·波特明白——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby thought his Bludger would be enough to make Harry Potter see--
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.38,1:06:28.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的游走球？是你让那游走球追我的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your Bludger? You made that Bludger chase after me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.92,1:06:32.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比觉得很委屈，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby feels most aggrieved, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.67,1:06:36.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比不得不熨自己的手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby had to iron his hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.51,1:06:43.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好趁我骨头还没长回来赶紧走开，不然我可能会掐死你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You better clear off before my bones come back, or I might strangle you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.73,1:06:47.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比习惯被威胁处死了，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby is used to death threats, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.90,1:06:50.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比在家一天要听五次呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby gets them five times a day at home.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.15,1:06:53.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想你大概不会告诉我，你为什么想杀我吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't suppose you could tell me why you're trying to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.20,1:06:58.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是杀您，先生。绝对不是杀您。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not kill you, sir. Never kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.24,1:07:01.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比记得哈利·波特战胜……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby remembers how it was before Harry Potter triumphed...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.74,1:07:04.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……神秘人之前的日子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...over He-Who-Must-Not-Be-Named.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.04,1:07:08.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们家养小精灵被当成害虫一样对待，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We house-elves were treated like vermin, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.92,1:07:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，多比现在还是被当成害虫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course, Dobby is still treated like vermin.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.72,1:07:26.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比，你为什么戴着那玩意儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why do you wear that thing, Dobby?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.48,1:07:31.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个吗，先生？这是家养小精灵被奴役的标记。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This, sir? It is a mark of the house-elf's enslavement.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.77,1:07:36.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有主人给多比衣服，多比才能获得自由。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby can only be freed if his master presents him with clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.07,1:07:40.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.58,1:07:42.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我说！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.28,1:07:46.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}霍格沃茨即将发生可怕的事情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Terrible things are about to happen at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.62,1:07:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利·波特不能留在这里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry Potter must not stay here...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.25,1:07:53.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……既然历史即将重演。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...now that history is to repeat itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.96,1:07:57.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}重演？你是说以前发生过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Repeat itself? You mean this has happened before?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.59,1:07:59.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比不该说这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I shouldn't have said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.31,1:08:06.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-坏多比！坏多比！  -住手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bad Dobby! Bad!   -Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.64,1:08:08.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手，多比！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop it, Dobby!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.98,1:08:13.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉我。以前是什么时候发生的？现在是谁干的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me. When did this happen before? Who's doing it now?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.98,1:08:19.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比不能说，先生。多比只希望哈利·波特平安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby cannot say, sir. Dobby only wants Harry Potter to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.36,1:08:21.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，多比。告诉我。是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Dobby. Tell me. Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.13,1:08:35.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他放这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put him here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.80,1:08:40.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发生什么事了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.01,1:08:42.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又发生了一起袭击。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's been another attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.97,1:08:48.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}庞弗雷夫人，我想他是被石化了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think he's been Petrified, Madam Pomfrey.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.48,1:08:54.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看。也许他拍到了袭击者的照片。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look. Perhaps he managed to take a picture of his attacker.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.32,1:09:05.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿不思，这意味着什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What can this mean, Albus?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.20,1:09:07.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这意味着……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It means...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.54,1:09:10.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我们的学生处境非常危险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that our students are in great danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.50,1:09:13.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我该怎么跟教职员工说？  -实话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What should I tell the staff? The truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.17,1:09:17.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉他们霍格沃茨已不再安全。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell them Hogwarts is no longer safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.30,1:09:21.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}米勒娃，正如我们担心的那样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is as we feared, Minerva.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.51,1:09:26.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}密室确实又被打开了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Chamber of Secrets has indeed been opened again.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.85,1:09:33.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是说密室以前被打开过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You mean the Chamber of Secrets has been opened before?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.19,1:09:35.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。你还不明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course. Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.06,1:09:39.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一定是卢修斯·马尔福在这里上学时打开的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lucius Malfoy must have opened it when he was at school here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.69,1:09:42.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-现在他又教了德拉科怎么做。  -也许吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Now he's taught Draco how to do it.   -Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.45,1:09:45.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得等复方汤剂做好才知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll have to wait for the Polyjuice Potion to know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.82,1:09:49.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我明白一下。我们为什么大白天熬这药……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Enlighten me. Why are we brewing this potion in broad daylight...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.91,1:09:53.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……还是在女生盥洗室里？你不觉得会被发现吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...in the middle of the girls' lavatory? Don't you think we'll get caught?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.75,1:09:57.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会。这里从来没人来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. No one ever comes in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.25,1:10:00.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-为什么？  -因为哭泣的桃金娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why?   -Moaning Myrtle.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.01,1:10:02.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.38,1:10:05.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哭泣的桃金娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Moaning Myrtle.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.39,1:10:08.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哭泣的桃金娘是谁？  -我就是哭泣的桃金娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Who's Moaning Myrtle?   -I'm Moaning Myrtle.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.65,1:10:17.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也没指望你们认识我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wouldn't expect you to know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.23,1:10:20.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁会谈论又丑又可怜的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who would ever talk about ugly, miserable...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.40,1:10:23.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……闷闷不乐的哭泣的桃金娘呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...moping Moaning Myrtle?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.00,1:10:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她有点敏感。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's a little sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.63,1:10:39.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都围过来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gather round!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.92,1:10:44.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都围过来。大家都能看见我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gather round. Can everybody see me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.09,1:10:48.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都能听见我说话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you all hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.93,1:10:50.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.77,1:10:54.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鉴于最近几周发生的黑暗事件……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In light of the dark events of recent weeks...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.60,1:10:59.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……邓布利多教授批准我创办这个决斗俱乐部……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Professor Dumbledore has granted me permission to start this Dueling Club...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.44,1:11:04.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……训练你们，以备将来需要自卫……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to train you all up in case you ever need to defend yourselves...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.40,1:11:06.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……就像我本人无数次做过的那样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...as I myself have done on countless occasions.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.11,1:11:10.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}详细情况请看我出版的著作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For full details, see my published works.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.69,1:11:19.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个洛哈特真了不起，是吧？非常勇敢的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That Lockhart's something, isn't he? Awfully brave chap.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.32,1:11:20.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贾斯廷·芬列里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Justin Finch-Fletchley.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.78,1:11:22.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-赫奇帕奇。  -很高兴认识你。我是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hufflepuff.   -Nice to meet you. I'm--
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.70,1:11:25.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你是谁。我们都知道，连我们这些麻瓜出身的也知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know who you are. We all do, even us Muggle-borns.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.12,1:11:29.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我介绍一下我的助手……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me introduce my assistant...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.42,1:11:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……斯内普教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Professor Snape.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.42,1:11:38.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他很大度地同意帮忙做个简短的示范。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He has sportingly agreed to help with a short demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.34,1:11:40.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不希望你们这些年轻人担心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want any of you youngsters to worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.59,1:11:45.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我解决他之后，你们的魔药课老师还在。别怕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll still have your Potions master when I'm through with him. Never fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.11,1:12:02.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.91,1:12:03.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}二。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.78,1:12:07.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-三！  -除你武器！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Three!   -Expelliarmus!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.38,1:12:19.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你觉得他没事吧？  -谁在乎？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Do you think he's all right?   -Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.22,1:12:22.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯内普教授，给他们演示这招真是个好主意……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An excellent idea to show them that, Professor Snape...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.34,1:12:26.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……不过恕我直言，你的意图太明显了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but if you don't mind me saying, it was obvious what you were about to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.10,1:12:30.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我想阻止你，那简直易如反掌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I had wanted to stop you, it would have been only too easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.48,1:12:33.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许更稳妥的做法是先教学生们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perhaps it would be prudent to first teach the students...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.15,1:12:38.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……如何挡住不友好的咒语，教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to block unfriendly spells, professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.36,1:12:42.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯内普教授，这建议好极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An excellent suggestion, Professor Snape.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.03,1:12:48.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来一对自愿者。波特、韦斯莱，你们俩怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's have a volunteer pair. Potter, Weasley, how about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.49,1:12:52.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}韦斯莱的魔杖使最简单的咒语都能造成灾难。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Weasley's wand causes devastation with the simplest spells.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.37,1:12:56.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得用火柴盒把波特送去校医院了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll be sending Potter to the hospital wing in a matchbox.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.25,1:13:00.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我建议从我自己的学院里选一个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Might I suggest someone from my own house?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.63,1:13:04.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许马尔福？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Malfoy, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.64,1:13:14.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你好运，波特。 -谢谢您，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good luck, Potter.   -Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.07,1:13:24.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}魔杖预备。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wands at the ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.70,1:13:27.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-怕了，波特？  -想得美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Scared, Potter?   -You wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.08,1:13:39.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}数到三……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On the count of three...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.96,1:13:44.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……施咒解除对手的武器。只准解除武器。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...cast your charms to disarm your opponent. Only to disarm.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.47,1:13:48.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不想出任何意外。一。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't want any accidents here. One.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.80,1:13:52.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-二。  -翻倒咒！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Two.   -Everte Statum!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.99,1:14:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咧嘴呼啦啦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rictusempra!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.25,1:14:19.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说了只准缴械。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I said disarm only.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.21,1:14:21.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乌龙出洞！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Serpensortia!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.84,1:14:32.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别动，波特。我来替你除掉它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't move, Potter. I'll get rid of it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.81,1:14:38.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}交给我，斯内普教授。阿拉特·艾森丹！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Allow me, Professor Snape. Alarte Ascendare!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.81,1:15:23.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蝰蛇消失。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vipera Evanesca.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.16,1:15:32.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在搞什么名堂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you playing at?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.34,1:15:48.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是蛇佬腔？你怎么没告诉我们？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a Parselmouth? Why didn't you tell us?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.17,1:15:50.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我是什——什么？  -你能跟蛇说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm a what?   -You can talk to snakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.59,1:15:55.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。我有一次在动物园不小心放了条蟒蛇去咬我表哥达力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know. I accidentally set a python on my cousin Dudley at the zoo once.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.10,1:16:00.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就一次。那又怎样？我敢说这儿很多人都会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Once. But so what? I bet loads of people here can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.23,1:16:04.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，他们不会。这可不是什么常见的本事，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, they can't. It's not a very common gift, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.52,1:16:06.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可不妙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.36,1:16:10.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么不妙？要不是我叫那条蛇别攻击贾斯廷——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's bad? If I hadn't told that snake not to attack Justin--
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.32,1:16:13.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你对它说的就是这个。  -你当时在场。你听见了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's what you said to it.   -You were there. You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.91,1:16:17.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听见你在说蛇佬腔。蛇的语言。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I heard you speaking Parseltongue. Snake language.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.95,1:16:20.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说的是另一种语言？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I spoke a different language?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.92,1:16:24.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我并不知道——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I didn't realize--
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.46,1:16:27.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么可能在不知道自己会说的情况下说一门语言？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How can I speak a language without knowing I can?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.42,1:16:31.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道，但听起来你像是在怂恿那条蛇什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know, but it sounded like you were egging the snake on or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.59,1:16:33.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.72,1:16:36.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯莱特林学院的标志是蛇，这是有原因的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a reason the symbol of Slytherin house is a serpent.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.76,1:16:41.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}萨拉查·斯莱特林就是个蛇佬腔。他也能跟蛇说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Salazar Slytherin was a Parselmouth. He could talk to snakes too.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.52,1:16:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.73,1:16:46.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在全校都会以为你是他的曾曾曾孙子了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now the whole school's gonna think you're his great-great-great grandson.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.27,1:16:48.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.99,1:16:52.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不可能是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.07,1:16:56.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是一千年前的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He lived a thousand years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.28,1:16:59.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说不定你真是呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For all we know, you could be.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.18,1:17:16.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是谁，海德薇？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who am I, Hedwig?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.22,1:17:19.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我到底是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.80,1:17:57.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}公共休息室见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll see you back in the common room.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.73,1:18:15.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之，我让贾斯廷躲在我们宿舍里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So anyway, I told Justin to hide up in our dormitory.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.20,1:18:19.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，如果波特把他定成下一个目标……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean to say, if Potter has marked him down as his next victim...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.74,1:18:22.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……他最好还是低调一阵子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}.. it's best he keeps a low profile for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.49,1:18:25.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可波特为什么要攻击贾斯廷？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But why would he want to attack Justin?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.41,1:18:30.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为贾斯廷不小心跟波特说漏了他是麻瓜出身。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Justin let it slip to Potter that he was Muggle-born.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.34,1:18:34.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真觉得波特是斯莱特林的继承人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you definitely think Potter is the Heir of Slytherin?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.34,1:18:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汉娜，他是蛇佬腔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hannah, he's a Parselmouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.84,1:18:40.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家都知道那是黑巫师的标志。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone knows that's the mark of a dark wizard.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.72,1:18:44.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听说过哪个正派的巫师会跟蛇说话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you ever heard of a decent one who could talk to snakes?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.02,1:18:48.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们管斯莱特林本人叫“蛇舌”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They called Slytherin himself "Serpent-tongue."
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.35,1:18:50.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可哈利看上去一直挺好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry always seemed so nice though.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.15,1:18:55.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且毕竟是他让神秘人消失的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And after all, he is the one who made You-Know-Who disappear.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.94,1:19:00.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说不定神秘人一开始想杀他就是这个原因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's probably why You-Know-Who wanted to kill him in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.28,1:19:03.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不想有另一个黑魔王跟他争。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Didn't want another Dark Lord competing with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.22,1:19:20.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，哈利。你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Harry. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.51,1:19:23.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格。你在这儿干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hagrid. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.51,1:19:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这学期第二只了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Second one killed this term.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.77,1:19:29.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我估摸着不是狐狸就是吸血怪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, I reckon it's either a fox or a Blood-Sucking Bugbear.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.31,1:19:31.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚去邓布利多那儿得到许可……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been up at Dumbledore's getting permission...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.94,1:19:34.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……给老鸡笼施个小咒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to put a little charm round the old hen coop.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.94,1:19:39.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定没事？你看起来心神不宁的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You sure you're all right? You're awful hot and bothered.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.07,1:19:41.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.20,1:19:46.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得走了。我还有好多东西要学……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I'd better get going. I've got a lot of studying to....
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.21,1:20:07.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要血。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.35,1:20:15.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们都得死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They all must die.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.93,1:20:17.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.60,1:20:20.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.48,1:20:23.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.11,1:20:28.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该杀了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.36,1:21:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当场抓获。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Caught in the act.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.48,1:21:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次我一定要把你赶出去，波特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll have you out this time, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.90,1:21:09.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你记住我的话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.57,1:21:13.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。费尔奇先生！你不明白——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Mr. Filch! You don't understand--
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.56,1:21:42.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教授……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.69,1:21:44.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我发誓不是我干的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I swear I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.31,1:21:47.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事我做不了主，波特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is out of my hands, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.12,1:21:59.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邓布利多教授在等你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor Dumbledore will be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.71,1:22:11.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}柠檬雪宝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sherbet Lemon.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.25,1:22:47.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邓布利多教授？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor Dumbledore?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.89,1:23:06.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有心事，波特？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bee in your bonnet, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.44,1:23:13.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是在想，你是不是把我分对了学院。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was just wondering if you put me in the right house.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.15,1:23:19.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。你特别难分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. You were particularly difficult to place.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.78,1:23:23.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我去年说的话我依然坚持。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I stand by what I said last year.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.50,1:23:26.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在斯莱特林会很有出息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You would have done well in Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.04,1:23:28.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你错了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.66,1:23:59.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.49,1:24:01.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.87,1:24:05.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的鸟……我也无能为力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your bird.... There was nothing I could do.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.25,1:24:09.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-它刚着火了。  -也该着了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He just caught fire.   -And about time too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.46,1:24:12.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它好几天都看着挺糟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's been looking dreadful for days.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.96,1:24:14.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可惜你偏偏在它涅槃这天看见了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pity you had to see him on a burning day.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.84,1:24:20.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}福克斯是凤凰，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fawkes is a phoenix, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.26,1:24:23.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到了该死的时候，它们就会燃烧起来……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They burst into flame when it is time for them to die...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.77,1:24:25.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……然后它们就会……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and then they are...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.06,1:24:29.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……从灰烬中重生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..reborn from the ashes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.53,1:24:40.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凤凰真是神奇的生物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fascinating creatures, phoenixes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.57,1:24:44.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们能扛起极重的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They can carry immensely heavy loads.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.62,1:24:47.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们的眼泪有治愈的能力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Their tears have healing powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.08,1:24:53.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邓布利多教授！等等！听我说！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor Dumbledore, sir! Wait! Listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.13,1:24:56.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邓布利多教授，不是哈利干的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor Dumbledore, sir, it wasn't Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.51,1:24:59.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-海格—— -我敢在魔法部面前发誓。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hagrid-- -I'd swear it in front of the Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.55,1:25:01.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.76,1:25:03.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放松点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.39,1:25:06.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不认为……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do not believe...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.56,1:25:11.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哈利攻击过任何人。  -你当然不这么认为。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...that Harry attacked anyone.   -Of course you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.81,1:25:13.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.77,1:25:16.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，那我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Well, I'll...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.57,1:25:19.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那我在外面等着。  -好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'll just wait outside, then.   -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.32,1:25:27.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-教授，您不觉得是我干的吗？  -不，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You don't think it was me, professor?   -No, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.16,1:25:29.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不认为是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do not think it was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.75,1:25:32.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我必须问你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I must ask you...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.08,1:25:37.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你有什么想告诉我的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..1S there something you wish to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.79,1:25:45.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.92,1:25:47.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.42,1:25:52.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.76,1:25:54.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Off you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.78,1:26:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，大家看，是斯莱特林的继承人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, look, everyone. It's the Heir of Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.49,1:26:20.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心点，他是个非常邪恶的巫师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be careful. He's a seriously evil wizard.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.70,1:26:24.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧，哈利，弗雷德和乔治只是开个玩笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, come on, Harry. Fred and George were just having a laugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.87,1:26:27.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也就只有他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're the only ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.25,1:26:31.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}学校一半的人都以为你每晚溜去密室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Half the school thinks you're nipping off to the Chamber of Secrets every night.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.50,1:26:32.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁在乎？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.21,1:26:34.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许他们说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe they're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.68,1:26:40.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利。哈利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry. Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.22,1:26:42.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.81,1:26:45.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我根本不知道自己会说蛇佬腔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I didn't know I could speak Parseltongue.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.19,1:26:48.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我对自己还有多少不知道的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What else don't I know about myself?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.31,1:26:51.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.36,1:26:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……也许你会做出一些事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... maybe you can do something...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.44,1:26:58.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……甚至是可怕的事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...even something horrible...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.12,1:27:00.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……却不知道自己做过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and not know you did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.16,1:27:04.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不相信这些的，哈利，我知道你不信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't believe that, Harry. I Know you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.45,1:27:09.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果这能让你好受点，马尔福也留下来过节。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And if it makes you feel any better, Malfoy's staying for the holidays too.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.79,1:27:12.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那怎么会让人好受？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why would that make anyone feel any better?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.25,1:27:16.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为再过几天，复方汤剂就准备好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because in a few days, the Polyjuice Potion will be ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.63,1:27:18.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再过几天……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In a few days...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.09,1:27:22.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我们就能真正知道谁是斯莱特林的继承人了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...we may truly know who is the Heir of Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.03,1:27:51.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都准备好了，我们只需要一点你们要变成的人身上的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything's set. We just need a bit of who you're changing into.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.74,1:27:53.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克拉布和高尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crabbe and Goyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.62,1:27:56.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们还得确保真正的克拉布和高尔……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We also need to make sure that the real Crabbe and Goyle...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.58,1:27:59.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……在我们审问马尔福的时候不会闯进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...can't burst in on us while we're interrogating Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.13,1:28:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-怎么弄？  -我都想好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How?   -I've got it all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.05,1:28:05.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在里面灌了简单的催眠药水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I filled these with a simple Sleeping Draught.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.76,1:28:08.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}简单，但很有效。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Simple, but powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.72,1:28:10.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等他们睡着了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, once they're asleep...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.06,1:28:14.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……就把他们藏进扫帚柜，拔几根他们的头发……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...hide them in the broomstick cupboard and pull out a few of their hairs...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.43,1:28:16.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……再穿上他们的校服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and put on their uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.48,1:28:19.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那你要拔谁的头发？  -我已经拿到我的了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Whose hair are you ripping out, then?   -I've already got mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.94,1:28:23.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}米利森·伯斯德，斯莱特林的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Millicent Bulstrode. Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.28,1:28:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从她袍子上弄到的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got this off her robes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.61,1:28:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去看看复方汤剂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going to go check on the Polyjuice Potion.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.41,1:28:31.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确保让克拉布和高尔发现这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make sure that Crabbe and Goyle find these.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.25,1:28:45.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩，也许该我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron, maybe I should do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.80,1:28:47.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.09,1:28:51.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}羽加迪姆·勒维奥萨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wingardium Leviosa.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.02,1:29:03.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.80,1:29:28.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还能有多蠢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How thick could you get?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.80,1:29:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，把她们弄开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, let's get them.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.75,1:29:48.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样，拿到头发了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, did you get the hairs?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.34,1:29:50.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are those?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.88,1:29:54.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斯莱特林的袍子，我从洗衣房偷来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Slytherin robes. I had to sneak them from the laundry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.22,1:29:57.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们真要喝那个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are we going to drink that?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.10,1:29:59.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.04,1:30:08.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只有整整一小时，之后就会变回自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll have exactly one hour before we change back into ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.22,1:30:18.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把头发放进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Add the hairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.60,1:30:24.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，克拉布精华。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh. Essence of Crabbe.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.60,1:30:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干杯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.23,1:30:37.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我快吐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I'm gonna be sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.57,1:30:42.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.29,1:31:29.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.46,1:31:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.79,1:31:33.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bloody hell!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.71,1:31:37.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的声音还是自己的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We still sound like ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.17,1:31:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得学得像克拉布一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to sound more like Crabbe.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.13,1:31:42.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-天哪。  -太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bloody hell.   -Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.72,1:31:45.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-可赫敏呢？我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-But where's Hermione? I....
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.39,1:31:48.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我恐怕去不了了，你们先走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think I'm going. You go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.60,1:31:50.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫敏，你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hermione, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.48,1:31:53.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走吧，别浪费时间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just go. You're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.36,1:31:57.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.53,1:32:04.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-斯莱特林公共休息室在这边。  -好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-The Slytherin common room's this way.   -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.87,1:32:09.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.16,1:32:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们在干——？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing d--?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.21,1:32:15.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你们在这下面干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, what are you doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.21,1:32:19.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我正好是级长。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I happen to be a school prefect.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.13,1:32:24.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你们，可没理由晚上在走廊里闲逛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You, on the other hand, have no business wandering the corridors at night.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.18,1:32:27.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们叫什么来着？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are your names again?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.18,1:32:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我是……  -克拉布，高尔，你们去哪了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm....   -Crabbe, Goyle, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.35,1:32:34.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一直在礼堂里大吃大喝？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pigging out in the Great Hall all this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.86,1:32:38.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么戴眼镜？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you wearing glasses?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.02,1:32:41.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-看书。  -看书？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Reading.   -Reading?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.03,1:32:45.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都不知道你识字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't Know you could read.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.20,1:32:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这下面干什么，韦斯莱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what are you doing down here, Weasley?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.41,1:32:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}注意你的态度，马尔福。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mind your attitude, Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.26,1:33:03.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，坐下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.05,1:33:09.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看韦斯莱家那副样子，真看不出他们是纯血统。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'd never know the Weasleys were pure-bloods, the way they behave.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.10,1:33:13.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们是魔法界的耻辱，全都是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're an embarrassment to the wizarding world. All of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.77,1:33:17.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么了，克拉布？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's wrong with you, Crabbe?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.27,1:33:21.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肚子疼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stomachache.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.07,1:33:27.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《预言家日报》居然没报道这些袭击事件，真让我意外。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm surprised the Daily Prophet hasn't done a report on all these attacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.07,1:33:30.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜邓布利多是想把这事压下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I suppose Dumbledore is trying to hush it all up.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.74,1:33:33.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我父亲总说邓布利多是最糟糕的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Father always said Dumbledore was the worst thing...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.33,1:33:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……这地方发生过的事。－你错了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...that ever happened to this place.   -You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.63,1:33:45.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.97,1:33:49.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得这儿有人比邓布利多还糟？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think there's someone here who's worse than Dumbledore?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.80,1:33:52.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么？有吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.76,1:33:54.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利·波特？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry Potter?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.23,1:34:02.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说得好，高尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good one, Goyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.78,1:34:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得太对了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.98,1:34:06.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}圣人波特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Saint Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.82,1:34:10.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}居然真有人觉得他是斯莱特林的继承人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And people actually think that he's the Heir of Slytherin?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.37,1:34:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你总该知道是谁干的吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But then you must have some idea who's behind it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.16,1:34:20.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我不知道，高尔。我昨天就告诉你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know I don't, Goyle. I told you yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.84,1:34:24.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还要我说多少遍？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.34,1:34:27.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.64,1:34:34.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我父亲确实说过：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But my father did say this:
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.39,1:34:37.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}密室上次被打开是五十年前。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's been 50 years since the Chamber was opened.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.48,1:34:41.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不肯告诉我是谁打开的，只说那人被开除了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He wouldn't tell me who opened it. Only that they were expelled.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.15,1:34:46.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上次密室被打开时，有个泥巴种死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The last time the Chamber of Secrets was opened, a Mudblood died.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.99,1:34:51.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以这次他们中有人被杀，只是时间问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So it's only a matter of time before one of them is killed this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.87,1:34:53.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至于我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As for me...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.87,1:34:56.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我希望是格兰杰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I hope it's Granger.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.20,1:34:58.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们两个怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the matter with you two?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.58,1:35:01.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们表现得很奇怪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're acting very odd.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.29,1:35:03.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他肚子疼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's his stomachache.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.67,1:35:05.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冷静点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.88,1:35:11.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伤疤。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.51,1:35:16.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}头发。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.06,1:35:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！你去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.10,1:35:49.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was close.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.56,1:35:52.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫敏，出来吧。我们有很多事要告诉你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hermione, come out. We've got loads to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.19,1:35:54.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.52,1:35:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看了就知道，糟透了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait till you see. It's awful.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.36,1:36:02.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫敏？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hermione?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.28,1:36:03.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.99,1:36:07.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还记得我跟你说过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you remember me telling you...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.91,1:36:11.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……复方汤剂只能用来变成人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that the Polyjuice Potion was only for human transformations?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.25,1:36:15.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从米里森·伯斯德的袍子上拔下来的，是猫毛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was cat hair I plucked off Millicent Bulstrode's robes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.75,1:36:19.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看我的脸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at my face.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.42,1:36:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看你的尾巴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at your tail.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.43,1:36:30.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟赫敏说过话了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you spoken to Hermione?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.06,1:36:33.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她过几天就能出院……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She should be out of hospital in a few days...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.77,1:36:36.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……等她不再咳出毛球的时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...when she stops coughing up fur balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.40,1:36:43.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.74,1:36:48.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恶心！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.95,1:36:51.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看样子是哭泣的桃金娘把厕所淹了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Looks like Moaning Myrtle's flooded the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.97,1:37:12.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又来朝我扔东西？－我为什么要朝你扔东西？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come to throw something else at me?   -Why would I throw something at you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.56,1:37:16.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别问我。我就在这儿待着，谁也没惹……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't ask me. Here I am, minding my own business...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.77,1:37:20.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……结果有人觉得拿书砸我很好玩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and someone thinks it's funny to throw a book at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.61,1:37:23.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可别人朝你扔东西也伤不到你啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it can't hurt if someone throws something at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.65,1:37:26.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，东西会直接穿过你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, it'll just go right through you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.11,1:37:31.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对啊！大家都来拿书砸桃金娘吧，反正她没感觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure! Let's all throw books at Myrtle because she can't feel it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.66,1:37:34.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿过她肚子得十分！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ten points if you get it through her stomach!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.46,1:37:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿过她脑袋得五十分！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fifty points if it goes through her head!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.46,1:37:42.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可到底是谁扔的？－不知道，我没看见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-But who threw it at you, anyway?   -I don't know. I didn't see them.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.21,1:37:47.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当时就坐在下水弯管里，想着死亡……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was just sitting in the U-bend, thinking about death...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.68,1:37:51.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……它就穿过我的头顶掉下来了。嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and it fell through the top of my head. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.20,1:38:12.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这本日记里有个名字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a name in this diary.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.53,1:38:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“汤姆·马沃罗·里德尔。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Tom Marvolo Riddle."
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.16,1:38:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汤姆·马沃罗·里德尔？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tom Marvolo Riddle?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.79,1:38:23.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，我知道这个名字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hang on. I know that name.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.84,1:38:26.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我为什么知道这个名字？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why do I know that name?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.51,1:38:29.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对了，那天晚上我被罚关禁闭。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course. That night I had detention.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.80,1:38:32.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的任务是擦奖杯陈列室的银器。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My job was to polish the silver in the trophy room.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.14,1:38:34.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我记得……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I remember...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.93,1:38:38.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……因为我一直对着汤姆·里德尔的奖杯吐鼻涕虫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...because I kept burping up slugs over Tom Riddle's trophy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.81,1:38:42.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那奖杯是为什么得的？－他五十年前获过一个奖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What was the trophy for?   -He won an award 50 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.77,1:38:45.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好像是“对学校的特殊贡献”之类的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Special services to the school or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.44,1:38:47.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}五十年前？你确定？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fifty years ago? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.24,1:38:48.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确定。怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.24,1:38:51.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你忘了马尔福说的话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you remember what Malfoy told you?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.41,1:38:54.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上次密室被打开——－五十年前。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Last time the Chamber was openecd-- -Fifty years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.70,1:38:56.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是说——汤姆·里德尔当时在这儿……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That means-- Tom Riddle was here...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.70,1:38:58.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……事发时他就在霍格沃茨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...at Hogwarts when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.91,1:39:01.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是他把自己看到的写下来了呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What if he wrote about what he saw?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.75,1:39:05.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他可能知道密室在哪儿，怎么打开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's possible he knew where the Chamber was. How to open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.55,1:39:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}甚至里面住着什么怪物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even what sort of creature lives in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.97,1:39:11.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果是这样，那这些袭击的幕后黑手……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If so, whoever's behind these attacks...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.47,1:39:15.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……肯定不想让这本日记落在外面，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...wouldn't want this diary lying around, would they?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.39,1:39:19.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这想法很妙，赫敏，但有个漏洞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a brilliant theory, Hermione, but there's just one flaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.14,1:39:22.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这本日记里什么都没写。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's nothing written in this diary.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.33,1:39:44.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不介意吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.66,1:39:54.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“汤姆·马沃罗·里德尔。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Tom Marvolo Riddle."
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.03,1:40:26.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的名字……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My name...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.53,1:40:29.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是哈利……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}.1S Harry...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.08,1:40:33.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……波特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.43,1:40:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知不知道……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know anything...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.43,1:40:58.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……关于密室的事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...about the Chamber of Secrets?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.24,1:41:11.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.41,1:41:14.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……告诉我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...tell me?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.98,1:42:20.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰一下，能告诉我这里是怎么回事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me. Could you tell me what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.86,1:42:26.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是汤姆·里德尔吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you Tom Riddle?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.36,1:42:28.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，你能听见我说话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.72,1:42:50.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}里德尔！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Riddle!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.05,1:42:52.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.76,1:42:54.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邓布利多教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.97,1:42:59.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邓布利多？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dumbledore?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.39,1:43:03.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这么晚还在外面游荡可不明智，汤姆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is not wise to be wandering around this late hour, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.06,1:43:07.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，教授。我想我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, professor. I suppose l....
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.57,1:43:09.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得亲自看看那些传闻是不是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had to see for myself if the rumors were true.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.36,1:43:13.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恐怕是真的，汤姆。是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm afraid they are, Tom. They are true.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.41,1:43:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}学校也要关闭吗？我没有家可回。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About the school as well? I don't have a home to go to.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.41,1:43:19.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们不会真的关闭霍格沃茨吧，教授？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They wouldn't really close Hogwarts, would they, professor?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.41,1:43:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白，汤姆，但恐怕……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I understand, Tom, but I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.75,1:43:25.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……迪佩特校长可能别无选择。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... qeadmaster Dippet may have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.88,1:43:30.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，如果这一切都停止了，如果抓到那个责任人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, if it all stopped, if the person responsible was caught...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.59,1:43:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是不是有什么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there something...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.64,1:43:37.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……想告诉我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you wish to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.89,1:43:41.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，先生。没什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, sir. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.15,1:43:51.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那好吧。你走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very well, then. Off you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.40,1:43:53.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚安，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good night, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.36,1:44:32.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们把你弄出来吧。晚上好，海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's get you out of there. Evening, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.61,1:44:36.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不得不把你交出去。我想你不是有意让它害死人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going to have to turn you in. I don't think you meant it to kill anyone....
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.12,1:44:39.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能。你不明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't. You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.62,1:44:42.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那死去女孩的父母明天就到。霍格沃茨至少能做的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The dead girl's parents will be here tomorrow. The least Hogwarts can do...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.95,1:44:45.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……就是确保杀死他们女儿的东西被除掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...IS make sure the thing that killed their daughter is slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.12,1:44:49.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是他。阿拉戈克从没杀过任何人。从来没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It wasn't him. Aragog never killed no one. Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.58,1:44:51.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怪物不适合当宠物，海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Monsters don't make good pets, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.88,1:44:53.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—现在，让开。  -—不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Now, stand aside.   -No!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.67,1:44:55.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—让开，海格。  -—不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Stand aside, Hagrid.   -No!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.80,1:44:57.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西斯腾·阿佩里奥！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cistem Aperio!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.39,1:45:06.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿拉尼亚·埃克苏迈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Arania Exumai!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.64,1:45:10.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿拉戈克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aragog!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.02,1:45:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能放你走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't let you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.98,1:45:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们会为这事没收你的魔杖，海格。你会被开除的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They'll have your wand for this, Hagrid. You'll be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.82,1:45:20.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hagrid!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.20,1:45:30.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hagrid!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.18,1:45:44.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.16,1:45:52.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗恩。罗恩，醒醒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ron. Ron, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.28,1:45:55.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.66,1:45:59.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是海格。五十年前是海格打开了密室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was Hagrid. Hagrid opened the Chamber of Secrets 50 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.87,1:46:14.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.08,1:46:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可能是海格。绝对不可能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It can't be Hagrid. It just can't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.00,1:46:22.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们根本不认识这个汤姆·里德尔。他听起来就是个卑鄙的告密者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't even know this Tom Riddle. He sounds like a dirty, rotten snitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.22,1:46:25.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那怪物杀了人，罗恩。换了我们谁不会那么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The monster had killed somebody, Ron. What would any of us have done?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.05,1:46:30.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，海格是我们的朋友。我们干脆去问问他吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, Hagrid's our friend. Why don't we just go and ask him about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.22,1:46:32.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那会是次愉快的拜访。“你好，海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That would be a cheerful visit. "Hello, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.06,1:46:36.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉我们，你最近有没有在城堡里放什么疯狂又毛茸茸的东西？”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell us, have you been setting anything mad and hairy loose in the castle lately?"
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.06,1:46:40.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疯狂又毛茸茸？你们不会是在说我吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mad and hairy? You wouldn't be talking about me, now, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.53,1:46:41.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.07,1:46:47.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你拿的是什么，海格？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's that you've got, Hagrid?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.16,1:46:52.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是食肉鼻涕虫驱除剂。给曼德拉草用的，你知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Flesh-Eating Slug Repellent. For the Mandrakes, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.91,1:46:56.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}按斯普劳特教授的说法，它们还得再长一阵子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, according to Professor Sprout, they've still got a bit of growing to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.75,1:47:00.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等它们的粉刺消了，我们就把它们切碎炖了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But once their acne's cleared up, we'll chop them up and stew them...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.42,1:47:03.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……然后就能让医院里那些人解除石化。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and then we'll get those people down at the hospital un-Petrified.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.13,1:47:08.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过在那之前，你们三个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the meantime, though, you three...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.18,1:47:11.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……最好自己多加小心。好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...ad best be looking after yourselves. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.06,1:47:14.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hm.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.27,1:47:21.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，纳威。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Neville.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.28,1:47:24.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，我不知道是谁干的，但你最好过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, I don't know who did it, but you'd better come.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.11,1:47:26.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.39,1:47:53.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肯定是格兰芬多的人。别人不知道我们的口令。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It had to be a Gryffindor. Nobody else knows our password.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.60,1:47:55.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非那不是学生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unless it wasn't a student.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.98,1:47:59.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管是谁，他们肯定在找什么东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoever it was, they must have been looking for something.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.60,1:48:00.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且他们找到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And they found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.73,1:48:04.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汤姆·里德尔的日记不见了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tom Riddle's diary is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.82,1:48:07.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，都听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.32,1:48:10.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要我们打出水平，赫奇帕奇根本没机会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We play our game, Hufflepuff doesn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.37,1:48:12.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们更强壮、更迅速、更聪明。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're stronger, quicker and smarter.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.41,1:48:15.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更别说他们怕死哈利会把他们石化……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to mention they're dead scared that Harry will Petrify them...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.62,1:48:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—只要他们飞近他一点。  -—嗯，那也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...if they fly anywhere near him.   -Well, that too.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.33,1:48:21.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦格教授。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor McGonagall.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.00,1:48:25.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—这场比赛取消了。  -—我们不能取消魁地奇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This match has been canceled.   -We can't cancel Quidditch.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.21,1:48:30.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安静，伍德。你和队友们回格兰芬多塔楼。马上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Silence, Wood. You and your teammates will go to Gryffindor Tower. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.34,1:48:33.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}波特，你和我去找韦斯莱先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Potter, you and I will find Mr. Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.39,1:48:35.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有样东西你们俩必须看看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's something the both of you have to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.02,1:48:41.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我警告你们，这可能有点让人震惊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I warn you. This could be a wee bit of a shock.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.03,1:48:51.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫敏！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hermione!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.36,1:48:54.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是在图书馆附近被发现的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She was found near the library...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.41,1:48:56.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……身边还有这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...along with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.91,1:49:00.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩有谁认得这个吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does it mean anything to either of you?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.92,1:49:02.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.60,1:49:18.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请大家注意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could I have your attention, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.10,1:49:24.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鉴于最近发生的事件，以下新规定立即生效：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because of recent events, these new rules will be put into effect immediately:
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.06,1:49:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“所有学生每晚六点前必须回到各自学院的公共休息室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"All students will return to their house common rooms by 6:00 every evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.40,1:49:34.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有学生每节课都由老师护送到教室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All students will be escorted to each lesson by a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.62,1:49:37.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不得例外。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No exceptions."
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.29,1:49:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还要告诉你们：\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I should tell you this:
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.50,1:49:44.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非这些袭击的元凶被抓住……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unless the culprit behind these attacks is caught...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.21,1:49:48.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……否则学校很可能被关闭。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..it is likely the school will be closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.85,1:50:02.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得跟海格谈谈，罗恩。我不信是他……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've got to talk to Hagrid, Ron. I can't believe it's him...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.98,1:50:05.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但如果上次真是他放出了那怪物……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but if he did set the monster loose last time...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.44,1:50:08.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……他会知道怎么进密室。那是个开头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...he'll know how to get inside the Chamber of Secrets. That's a start.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.78,1:50:10.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可你听见麦格说的了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you heard McGonagall.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.24,1:50:13.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了上课我们不许离开塔楼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're not allowed to leave the tower except for class.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.95,1:50:16.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看是该再把爸爸的旧斗篷拿出来用了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think it's time to get my dad's old cloak out again.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.17,1:50:28.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—准备好了吗？  -—好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ready?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.10,1:50:49.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁在那儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.60,1:50:55.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.85,1:50:57.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.52,1:51:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—你拿那个干什么？  -—没什么。我在等，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's that for?   -Nothing. I was expecting, uh....
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.03,1:51:06.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系。进来吧。我刚泡了一壶茶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It doesn't matter. Come on in. I just made a pot of tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.62,1:51:11.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格，你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hagrid, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.08,1:51:14.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没事。我挺好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm fine. I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.91,1:51:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听说赫敏的事了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you hear about Hermione?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.12,1:51:21.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，听说了。我当然听说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah. I heard about that, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.13,1:51:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我们得问你点事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, we have to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.47,1:51:30.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道是谁打开了密室吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know who's opened the Chamber of Secrets?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.35,1:51:35.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这件事你得明白的是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What you had to understand about that is--
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.27,1:51:38.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，躲到隐形衣下面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quick, under the cloak.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.56,1:51:42.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个字都别说。你们两个都安静点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't say a word. Be quiet, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.07,1:51:52.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-邓布利多教授。  -晚上好，海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Professor Dumbledore, sir.   -Good evening, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.28,1:51:54.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在想，我们能不能……？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wonder, could we...?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.91,1:51:57.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。进来吧，进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course. Come in. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.58,1:51:58.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是爸爸的上司。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's Dad's boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.08,1:52:02.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}康奈利·福吉，魔法部部长。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cornelius Fudge, Minister of Magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.88,1:52:07.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟糕的事，海格，非常糟糕的事。我不得不来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bad business, Hagrid, very bad business. Had to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.42,1:52:10.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三起针对麻瓜出身的袭击。事情已经闹得够大了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three attacks on Muggle-borns. Things have gone far enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.80,1:52:14.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-魔法部必须采取行动。  -可我从来没有——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-The Ministry's got to act.   -But I never--
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.26,1:52:16.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教授，您知道我从没干过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know I never, professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.18,1:52:19.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你明白，康奈利……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want it understood, Cornelius...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.44,1:52:21.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……海格……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..that Hagrid...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.44,1:52:23.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……拥有我的完全信任。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... as my full confidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.94,1:52:27.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿不思，你看，海格的案底对他不利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Albus, look, Hagrid's record is against him.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.90,1:52:30.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我得把他带走。  -带走我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I've got to take him. Take me?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.61,1:52:32.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带我去哪儿？不会是阿兹卡班监狱吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take me where? Not Azkaban prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.16,1:52:36.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恐怕我们别无选择，海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm afraid we have no choice, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.54,1:52:39.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已经到这儿了，福吉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Already here, Fudge?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.62,1:52:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.92,1:52:44.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来这儿干什么？滚出我的房子！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here? Get out of my house!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.30,1:52:46.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Believe me...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.13,1:52:51.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……待在你这种……我一点都不乐意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I take absolutely no pleasure being inside your....
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.22,1:52:55.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你管这叫房子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You call this a house?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.52,1:52:57.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.72,1:53:01.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是打电话到学校，听说校长在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I simply called up the school and was told the headmaster was here.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.81,1:53:05.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，你到底找我有什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, what exactly is it that you want with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.44,1:53:11.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和其他校董已经决定，你该让位了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The other governors and I have decided it's time for you to step aside.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.82,1:53:15.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是停职令。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is an order of suspension.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.25,1:53:24.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上面有全部十二个签名。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll find all 12 signatures on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.50,1:53:32.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恐怕我们觉得你已大不如前了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm afraid we feel you've rather lost your touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.47,1:53:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，出了这么多袭击事件……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, what with all these attacks...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.97,1:53:38.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……霍格沃茨就一个麻瓜出身的学生都不剩了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... there'll be no Muggle-borns left at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.89,1:53:43.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只能想象那对学校会是多大的损失。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can only imagine what an awful loss that would be to the school.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.60,1:53:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们不能把邓布利多教授带走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't take Professor Dumbledore away.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.11,1:53:48.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他带走，麻瓜出身的人就毫无希望了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take him away and the Muggle-borns won't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.86,1:53:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你记住我的话，接下来就要死人了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You mark my words, there'll be killings next!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.49,1:53:53.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这么想？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think so?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.28,1:53:55.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冷静点，海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Calm yourself, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.12,1:53:59.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果校董们希望我离开……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If the governors desire my removal...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.04,1:54:03.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我当然会让位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I will, of course, step aside.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.38,1:54:07.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}However...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.25,1:54:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你会发现，在霍格沃茨，帮助总会……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...you will find that help will always be given at Hogwarts...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.01,1:54:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……给予那些……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to those who...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.05,1:54:17.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……开口求助的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...ask for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.14,1:54:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}令人钦佩的情操。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Admirable sentiments.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.65,1:54:28.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们走吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.58,1:54:42.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}福吉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fudge.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.83,1:54:45.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.79,1:54:48.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.04,1:54:50.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.54,1:54:53.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果有人在找什么东西……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If anybody was looking for some stuff...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.26,1:54:58.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……那他们只要跟着蜘蛛走就行了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...then all they'd have to do would be to follow the spiders.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.26,1:55:00.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，那样就能给他们指对路。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yep. That would lead them right.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.06,1:55:02.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能说的就这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's all I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.68,1:55:08.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，还有，我不在的时候得有人喂牙牙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, and someone will need to feed Fang while I'm away.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.82,1:55:13.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.95,1:55:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hagrid's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.28,1:55:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邓布利多一走，每天都会有一桩袭击。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With Dumbledore gone, there'll be an attack a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.37,1:55:27.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.13,1:55:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.64,1:55:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走啊，牙牙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Fang.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.90,1:56:00.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.49,1:56:01.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.91,1:56:05.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听见海格说的了。“跟着蜘蛛走。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You heard what Hagrid said. "Follow the spiders."
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.37,1:56:08.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们在往禁林里去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're heading to the Dark Forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.04,1:56:14.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么是蜘蛛？为什么不是“跟着蝴蝶走”？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why spiders? Why couldn't it be "follow the butterflies"?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.21,1:56:52.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那边有东西在动。听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's something moving over there. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.09,1:56:55.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-听声音是个大家伙。  -大家伙？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It sounds like something big.   -Big?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.56,1:57:03.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利！哈利，是我们的车！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry! Harry, it's our car!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.89,1:57:09.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它肯定一直就在这儿。你看，森林把它变得野性十足了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It must've been here all the time. And, look, the forest has turned it wild.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.90,1:57:15.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。别跟丢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. We don't want to lose the trail.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.73,1:57:31.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，我不喜欢这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.66,1:57:39.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哈利，我一点都不喜欢这样。  -嘘！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Harry, I don't like this at all.   -Shush!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.38,1:57:53.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们现在能回去吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can we go back now?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.05,1:57:55.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.52,1:58:48.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.94,1:58:50.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别慌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.44,1:58:51.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hagrid?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.32,1:58:53.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.49,1:58:56.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是海格的朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're friends of Hagrid's.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.51,1:59:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你呢？你是阿拉戈克，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you? You're Aragog, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.34,1:59:19.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.80,1:59:23.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格以前从没派人进过我们的洞穴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hagrid has never sent men into our hollow before.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.81,1:59:26.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他遇到麻烦了。在学校那边，发生了一些袭击。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's in trouble. Up at the school, there have been attacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.52,1:59:29.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们认为是海格干的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They think it's Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.52,1:59:33.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们认为是他打开了密室。就像从前一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They think he opened the Chamber of Secrets. Like before.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.36,1:59:35.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是谎言。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.15,1:59:39.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格从没打开过密室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hagrid never opened the Chamber of Secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.70,1:59:42.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那你就不是那个怪物？  -不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Then you're not the monster? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.78,1:59:45.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那怪物是在城堡里出生的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The monster was born in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.00,1:59:51.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是一个旅行者把我从遥远的国度装在口袋里带给海格的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I came to Hagrid from a distant land in the pocket of a traveler.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.92,1:59:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哈利。  -嘘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Harry.   -Shush.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.50,2:00:00.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但如果你不是那怪物，那五十年前杀死那个女孩的是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But if you're not the monster, then what did kill that girl 50 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.22,2:00:03.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不谈这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We do not speak of it.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.56,2:00:09.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是一种古老的生物，我们蜘蛛最怕的就是它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is an ancient creature we spiders fear above all others.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.31,2:00:11.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你见过它吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But have you seen it?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.73,2:00:17.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了关我的那只箱子，城堡别的地方我都没见过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never saw any part of the castle but the box in which I was kept.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.74,2:00:20.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那女孩是在一间盥洗室里被发现的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The girl was discovered in a bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.07,2:00:25.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我被指控的时候，海格把我带到了这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When I was accused, Hagrid brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.74,2:00:27.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哈利！  -什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Harry!   -What?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.59,2:00:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，谢谢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.55,2:00:46.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我们走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll just go.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.22,2:00:48.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.14,2:00:50.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think not.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.10,2:00:56.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的子孙不会听我命令伤害海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My sons and daughters do not harm Hagrid on my command.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.73,2:00:59.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我没法不让它们吃鲜肉……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I cannot deny them fresh meat...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.36,2:01:03.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……尤其是它自己这么情愿地送上门来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...when it wanders so willingly into our midst.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.86,2:01:07.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}永别了，海格的朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goodbye, friend of Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.78,2:01:09.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在可以慌了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can we panic now?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.38,2:01:22.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会什么咒语吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Know any spells?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.42,2:01:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会一个，但对付这么多不够强。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One, but it's not powerful enough for all of them.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.76,2:01:28.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}需要赫敏的时候她偏偏不在。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's Hermione when you need her?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.03,2:01:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快跑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.45,2:01:50.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛退散！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Arania Exumai!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.83,2:01:57.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咕！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gol!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.14,2:02:09.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.14,2:02:17.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总算出来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Glad we're out of there.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.20,2:02:26.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛退散！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Arania Exumai!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.24,2:02:36.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-谢了。  -别客气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Thanks for that.   -Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.97,2:02:49.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带我们离开这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.60,2:02:51.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.35,2:02:57.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！快点儿，再快点儿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! Come on, move faster!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.27,2:03:01.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！走啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.12,2:03:21.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快起飞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get us in the air.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.25,2:03:23.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}飞行装置卡住了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The flying gear's jammed!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.80,2:03:31.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！拉啊！-我在拉了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on! Pull!   -I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.92,2:04:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟着蜘蛛走。跟着蜘蛛走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Follow the spiders. Follow the spiders.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.04,2:04:08.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格要是能从阿兹卡班出来，我非杀了他不可。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If Hagrid ever gets out of Azkaban, I'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.36,2:04:25.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，让我们进去到底有什么意义？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, what was the point of sending us in there?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.78,2:04:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们查到了什么？  -我们知道了一件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What have we found out?   -We know one thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.57,2:04:33.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海格从没打开过密室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hagrid never opened the Chamber of Secrets.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.12,2:04:36.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是无辜的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was innocent.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.63,2:04:54.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真希望你在，赫敏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wish you were here, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.64,2:04:56.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们需要你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.81,2:04:59.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在比任何时候都需要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now more than ever.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.83,2:05:20.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那是什么？  -罗恩……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's that?   -Ron....
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.12,2:05:25.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是赫敏被袭击那天在图书馆的原因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is why Hermione was in the library the day she was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.13,2:05:27.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.00,2:05:31.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“在游荡于我们土地上的众多可怕野兽中……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Of the many fearsome beasts that roam our land...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.17,2:05:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……没有比蛇怪更致命的了。它能活上几百年……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...none is more deadly than the basilisk. Capable of living for hundreds of years...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.93,2:05:39.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……任何与这巨蛇对视的人都会立刻死去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...instant death awaits any who meet this giant serpent's eye.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.89,2:05:42.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛见到它就逃。”罗恩，就是这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Spiders flee before it." Ron, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:43.06,2:05:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}密室里的怪物是蛇怪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The monster in the Chamber of Secrets is a basilisk.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.02,2:05:49.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我能听见它说话。它是条蛇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why I can hear it speak. It's a snake.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.28,2:05:55.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可如果它靠对视杀人，为什么没人死？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But if it kills by looking people in the eye, why is it no one's dead?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.21,2:06:09.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为没人真正跟它对视。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because no one did look it in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.09,2:06:13.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少没有直接对视。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not directly, at least.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.93,2:06:17.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}科林是通过相机看到的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colin saw it through his camera.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.30,2:06:21.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贾斯廷——贾斯廷一定是通过差点没头的尼克看到的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Justin-- Justin must have seen the basilisk through Nearly Headless Nick.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.56,2:06:25.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尼克正面中了招。可他是幽灵，不可能再死一次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nick got the full blast of it. But he's a ghost, he couldn't die again.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.73,2:06:28.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫敏有镜子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Hermione had the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.98,2:06:32.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我敢说她是用镜子看拐角，以防它出现。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I bet you she was using it to look around corners in case it came along.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.57,2:06:33.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那洛丽丝夫人呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Mrs. Norris?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:33.99,2:06:37.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我敢肯定她没有相机也没有镜子，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm pretty sure she didn't have a camera or a mirror, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.08,2:06:40.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The water.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.41,2:06:46.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那晚地上有水。她只看到了蛇怪的倒影。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There was water on the floor that night. She only saw the basilisk's reflection.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.09,2:06:55.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“蜘蛛见到它就逃。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Spiders flee before it."
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.22,2:06:58.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-全对上了。  -蛇怪是怎么到处跑的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It all fits.   -How's the basilisk been getting around?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.10,2:07:01.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么大一条脏蛇。总有人会看见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A dirty, great snake. Someone would have seen it.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.10,2:07:07.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫敏也回答了这个问题。-管道？它是靠水管移动的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hermione's answered that too.   -Pipes? It's using the plumbing.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.94,2:07:12.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还记得阿拉戈克说的五十年前那个女孩吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember what Aragog said about that girl 50 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.36,2:07:16.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她死在盥洗室里？要是她一直没离开呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She died in a bathroom? What if she never left?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.28,2:07:18.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哭泣的桃金娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Moaning Myrtle.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.62,2:07:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有学生立刻回到各自的宿舍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All students are to return to their dormitories at once.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.79,2:07:27.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有教师立刻到二楼走廊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All teachers to the second-floor corridor immediately.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.25,2:07:38.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如你们所见，斯莱特林的继承人又留下了一条信息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As you can see, the Heir of Slytherin has left another message.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.26,2:07:40.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们最担心的事发生了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our worst fear has been realized.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.64,2:07:45.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一名学生被怪物带进了密室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A student has been taken by the monster into the Chamber itself.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.27,2:07:51.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}必须把学生送回家。恐怕霍格沃茨到此为止了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The students must be sent home. I'm afraid this is the end of Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.32,2:07:56.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真抱歉。打了个盹。我错过了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So sorry. Dozed off. What have I missed?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.90,2:08:01.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个女孩被怪物抓走了，洛哈特。你的时刻终于到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A girl has been snatched by the monster, Lockhart. Your moment has come at last.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.41,2:08:04.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我的时刻？  -你昨晚不是还说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-My moment?   -Weren't you saying just last night...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.54,2:08:09.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你一直都知道密室入口在哪儿吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that you've known all along where the entrance to the Chamber of Secrets is?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.42,2:08:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就这么定了。怪物就交给你了，吉德罗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's settled. We'll leave you to deal with the monster, Gilderoy.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.09,2:08:21.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你的本领毕竟是传奇。  -好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Your skills, after all, are legend.   -Very well.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.43,2:08:24.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这就回办公室，做点……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll just be in my office getting...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.51,2:08:27.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做点准备。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Getting ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.35,2:08:33.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怪物抓走的是谁，米勒娃？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who is it that the monster's taken, Minerva?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.73,2:08:35.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金妮·韦斯莱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ginny Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.95,2:08:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“她的尸骨将永远留在密室里。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Her skeleton will lie in the Chamber forever."
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.08,2:08:55.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金妮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.96,2:09:01.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}洛哈特没用，但他会试着进密室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lockhart's useless, but he's going to try and get into the Chamber.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.63,2:09:04.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少我们可以把知道的告诉他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least we can tell him what we know.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.72,2:09:08.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教授，我们有情报要告诉你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Professor, we have some information for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.06,2:09:11.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要出门？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.14,2:09:15.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，是的。紧急事务。推不掉。必须得走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, yes. Urgent call. Unavoidable. Got to go.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.44,2:09:18.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那我妹妹怎么办？  -呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What about my sister?   -Well....
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.98,2:09:22.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至于这个，非常不幸。没人比我更遗憾了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As to that, most unfortunate. No one regrets more than I.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.66,2:09:26.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是黑魔法防御术老师。你现在不能走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the Defense Against the Dark Arts teacher. You can't go now.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.87,2:09:29.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得说，我接这份工作时，职位说明里可没写——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I must say, when I took the job, there was nothing in the description--
Dialogue: 0,2:09:30.00,2:09:31.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要逃跑？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're running away?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:31.37,2:09:34.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你在书里做了那么多事？  -书是会骗人的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-After all you did in your books?   -Books can be misleading.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.29,2:09:36.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是你写的。  -亲爱的孩子，动动脑子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You wrote them.   -My dear boy, use your common sense.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.00,2:09:41.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果人们不认为那些事是我做的，我的书也不会卖得那么好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My books wouldn't have sold as well if people didn't think I'd done those things.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.01,2:09:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是个骗子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.76,2:09:46.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一直在冒领别的巫师的功劳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've been taking credit for what other wizards have done.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:46.76,2:09:48.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有办法吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there anything you can do?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.89,2:09:53.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有，你一提我想起来了。我对遗忘咒很有天赋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, now you mention it. I'm rather gifted with Memory Charms.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:53.77,2:09:56.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然那些巫师早就到处乱说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Otherwise, all those wizards would have gone blabbing.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.44,2:09:59.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就再也卖不出一本书了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd never have sold another book.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.69,2:10:05.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事实上，我也得对你们如法炮制。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In fact, I'm going to have to do the same to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.95,2:10:08.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想都别想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.54,2:10:21.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁在那儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:23.47,2:10:25.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.43,2:10:31.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你想干什么？  -问问你是怎么死的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What do you want?   -To ask you how you died.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.98,2:10:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太可怕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was dreadful.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:36.56,2:10:40.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就发生在这间隔间里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It happened right here in this very cubicle.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.44,2:10:44.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我躲在这儿，因为奥利芙·霍恩比嘲笑我的眼镜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd hidden because Olive Hornby was teasing me about my glasses.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.65,2:10:49.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在哭，然后听见有人进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was crying, and then I heard somebody come in.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:49.70,2:10:56.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是谁，桃金娘？  -我不知道。我当时心烦意乱！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Who was it, Myrtle?   -I don't know. I was distraught!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.33,2:11:00.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但他说了些奇怪的话，像是编出来的语言。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But they said something funny, a kind of made-up language.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.96,2:11:07.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我意识到是个男孩，就打开门让他走开，然后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I realized it was a boy, so I unlocked the door to tell him to go away and...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:08.47,2:11:13.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-……我就死了。  -就这样？怎么死的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...I died.   -Just like that? How?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:13.47,2:11:17.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只记得看见一双又大又黄的眼睛……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just remember seeing a pair of great, big, yellow eyes...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.10,2:11:21.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……就在那边那个洗手池旁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...over there by that sink.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:47.05,2:11:49.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:50.01,2:11:54.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这里，罗恩。我想这就是密室的入口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is it, Ron. I think this is the entrance to the Chamber of Secrets.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:56.81,2:12:01.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说点什么。哈利，用蛇佬腔说点什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say something. Harry, say something in Parseltongue.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:53.20,2:12:57.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了，哈利。干得好。那么，我就先……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excellent, Harry. Good work. Well, then, I'll just be....
Dialogue: 0,2:12:57.45,2:12:59.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没必要留在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no need for me to stay.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:00.33,2:13:02.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有必要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, there is.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:04.08,2:13:07.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你先。  -孩子们，这有什么用呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You first.   -Now, boys, what good will it do?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.30,2:13:08.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去总比我们去好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Better you than us.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.84,2:13:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是——当然，好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But-- Obviously, yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:17.10,2:13:19.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定不先试试？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure you don't want to test it first?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.61,2:13:29.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下面真的很脏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's really quite filthy down here.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:30.32,2:13:34.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好吧，走吧。哦，哈利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-All right. Let's go. Oh, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.24,2:13:40.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是在下面死了，欢迎来跟我共用厕所。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you die down there, you're welcome to share my toilet.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:42.71,2:13:44.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢了，桃金娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks, Myrtle.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.86,2:14:11.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.78,2:14:18.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住：一有动静，马上闭上眼睛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, remember: Any sign of movement, close your eyes straightaway.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:19.91,2:14:21.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.29,2:14:26.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This way.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:33.67,2:14:38.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么？ -看起来像条蛇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's this?   -It looks like a snake.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:39.05,2:14:42.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是蛇皮。我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a snakeskin. Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:42.89,2:14:48.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜕下这皮的东西肯定有60英尺长。甚至更长。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever shed this must be 60 feet long. Or more.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:50.61,2:14:53.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这孩子有狮子般的胆量。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Heart of a lion, this one.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:57.28,2:15:01.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冒险到此结束了，孩子们。但别担心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The adventure ends here, boys. But don't fret.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:03.91,2:15:09.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}世人会知道我们的故事。我如何来不及救那姑娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The world will know our story. How I was too late to save the girl.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.71,2:15:13.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩如何不幸地精神失常……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How you two tragically lost your minds...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.34,2:15:16.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……一见到她被撕碎的身体。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..at the sight of her mangled body.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:17.22,2:15:18.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So....
Dialogue: 0,2:15:19.76,2:15:22.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你先来，波特先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You first, Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.35,2:15:25.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟你的记忆告别吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say goodbye to your memories.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:27.60,2:15:29.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一忘皆空！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Obliviate!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.26,2:15:58.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:59.13,2:16:01.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:03.47,2:16:06.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-罗恩！罗恩，你没事吧？  -我没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ron! Ron, are you okay?   -I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:10.31,2:16:12.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:12.77,2:16:14.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:15.98,2:16:18.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-罗恩·韦斯莱。  -真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ron Weasley.   -Really?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:18.82,2:16:21.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And who am I?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:23.41,2:16:27.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}洛哈特的遗忘咒反弹了。他根本不知道自己是谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lockhart's Memory Charm backfired. He hasn't got a clue who he is.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:28.08,2:16:32.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这地方挺奇怪的，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's an odd sort of place, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.79,2:16:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你住这儿吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you live here?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:35.59,2:16:38.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不。  -真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No.   -Really?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.68,2:16:44.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我现在怎么办？  -你在这儿等着……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What do I do now?   -You wait here...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:44.68,2:16:47.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……试着搬开些石头，好让我们能回去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and try and shift some of this rock so we can get back through.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.81,2:16:51.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我继续去找金妮。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'll go on and find Ginny. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:15.27,2:18:17.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金妮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:24.66,2:18:28.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金妮！金妮，求你别死。醒醒，醒醒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ginny! Ginny, please don't be dead. Wake up, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.03,2:18:31.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你醒醒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please wake up.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:31.41,2:18:33.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她不会醒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She won't wake.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:39.00,2:18:43.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汤姆。汤姆·里德尔。你说她不会醒了是什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tom. Tom Riddle. What do you mean, she won't wake?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.51,2:18:46.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-她不是……？  -她还活着，但也只是勉强。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-She's not...?   -She's still alive, but only just.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:47.93,2:18:50.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你是幽灵吗？  -一段记忆……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you a ghost?   -A memory...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.35,2:18:52.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……在日记里保存了五十年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...preserved in a diary for 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:55.44,2:19:00.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她冷得像冰。金妮，求你别死。醒醒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's cold as ice. Ginny, please don't be dead. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:00.82,2:19:03.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得帮我，汤姆。有条蛇怪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got to help me, Tom. There's a basilisk.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:03.36,2:19:05.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人召唤它就不会来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It won't come until it's called.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:08.74,2:19:11.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-把魔杖给我，汤姆。  -你不需要它了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Give me my wand, Tom.   -You won't be needing it.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:12.66,2:19:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们得走，得去救她。  -恐怕我不能那么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We've got to go. We've got to save her.   -I'm afraid I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:16.21,2:19:20.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，可怜的金妮越虚弱，我就越强大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see, as poor Ginny grows weaker, I grow stronger.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:21.59,2:19:26.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，哈利，打开密室的就是金妮·韦斯莱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, Harry, it was Ginny Weasley who opened the Chamber of Secrets.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:26.26,2:19:28.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。她不会的。她不可能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. She couldn't. She wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:28.76,2:19:32.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金妮放蛇怪去袭击泥巴种和费尔奇的猫……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ginny set the basilisk on the Mudbloods and Filch's cat...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:32.18,2:19:34.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……墙上的恐吓留言也是金妮写的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Ginny wrote the threatening messages on the walls.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:34.77,2:19:38.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？因为我让她这么做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But why? Because I told her to.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:38.23,2:19:43.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会发现我很有说服力。不过她并不知道自己在做什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll find I can be very persuasive. Not that she knew what she was doing.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:43.36,2:19:46.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以说，她当时处于一种恍惚状态。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She was, shall we say, in a kind of trance.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:47.24,2:19:49.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过，日记的力量开始让她害怕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Still, the power of the diary began to scare her.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:49.91,2:19:52.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她想把它丢在女生盥洗室里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She tried to dispose of it in the girls' bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:52.49,2:19:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果偏偏是你捡到了它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then who should find it but you?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:57.00,2:20:00.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我最想见的人正是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The very person I was most anxious to meet.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:00.71,2:20:02.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你为什么想见我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And why did you want to meet me?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:03.13,2:20:06.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道我必须跟你谈谈，如果可能的话见你一面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Knew I had to talk to you, meet you if I could.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:06.72,2:20:09.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我决定让你看看我抓住那个没脑子的傻大个海格的事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So I decided to show you my capture of that brainless oaf Hagrid...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:10.14,2:20:13.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……来赢得你的信任。 -海格是我的朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-...to gain your trust.   -Hagrid's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:14.22,2:20:18.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你陷害了他，对吧？  -当时只是我和海格各执一词。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-And you framed him, didn't you?   -It was my word against Hagrid's.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:19.02,2:20:22.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有邓布利多似乎认为他是无辜的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only Dumbledore seemed to think he was innocent.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:22.44,2:20:24.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我敢说邓布利多一眼就看穿了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll bet Dumbledore saw right through you.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:24.78,2:20:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从那以后，他确实盯得我很紧，真烦人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He certainly kept an annoyingly close watch on me after that.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:28.40,2:20:31.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道我在校期间再打开密室不安全……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Knew it wouldn't be safe to open the Chamber again while I was at school...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:31.91,2:20:33.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……所以我决定留下一本日记……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...sO I decided to leave behind a diary...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.91,2:20:35.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……把我十六岁的自己保存在书页里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...preserving my 16-year-old self in its pages...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:36.16,2:20:38.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……好让我有朝一日能引导另一个人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...so that one day I would be able to lead another...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:39.04,2:20:41.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……来完成萨拉查·斯莱特林的高尚事业。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to finish Salazar Slytherin's noble work.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:42.04,2:20:44.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次你可没能完成。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you haven't finished it this time.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:44.42,2:20:47.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再过几个小时，曼德拉草药剂就熬好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In a few hours, the Mandrake Draught will be ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:47.59,2:20:50.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有被石化的人都会恢复原样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And everyone who was Petrified will be all right again.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:50.67,2:20:55.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没告诉过你吗？杀泥巴种对我来说已经不重要了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Haven't I told you? Killing Mudbloods doesn't matter to me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:56.18,2:21:00.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这几个月来，我的新目标一直是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For many months now, my new target has been you.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:02.44,2:21:06.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个毫无非凡魔法天赋的婴儿……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How is it that a baby with no extraordinary magical talent...
Dialogue: 0,2:21:06.23,2:21:08.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……怎么可能打败史上最伟大的巫师？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...was able to defeat the greatest wizard of all time?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:09.19,2:21:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么只留下个伤疤就逃掉了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did you escape with nothing but a scar...
Dialogue: 0,2:21:12.32,2:21:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……而伏地魔大人的法力却被摧毁了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...while Lord Voldemort's powers were destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:14.87,2:21:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你管我怎么逃出来的？伏地魔是你之后才出现的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why do you care how I escaped? Voldemort was after your time.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:19.25,2:21:25.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伏地魔是我的过去、现在和未来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Voldemort is my past, present and future.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:46.15,2:21:49.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你。你就是斯莱特林的继承人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You. You're the Heir of Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:52.74,2:21:56.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你就是伏地魔。  -你该不会以为……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're Voldemort.   -Surely you didn't think...
Dialogue: 0,2:21:56.49,2:22:01.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我会留着我那肮脏的麻瓜父亲的名字吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I was going to keep my filthy Muggle father's name?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:01.16,2:22:05.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。我给自己造了个新名字，我知道只要我成为世上最伟大的巫师……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I fashioned myself a new name, a name I knew wizards everywhere...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:05.50,2:22:09.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……各地的巫师都会连提都不敢提这个名字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...would fear to speak when I became the greatest sorcerer in the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:09.88,2:22:13.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿不思·邓布利多是世上最伟大的巫师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Albus Dumbledore is the greatest sorcerer in the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:13.22,2:22:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}光是我的记忆，就把邓布利多赶出了这座城堡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dumbledore's been driven out of this castle by the mere memory of me.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:16.84,2:22:21.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他永远不会离开。只要留下的人还忠于他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He'll never be gone. Not as long as those who remain are loyal to him.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.23,2:22:29.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}福克斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fawkes?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:45.54,2:22:49.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原来邓布利多就给他伟大的守护者派来这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So this is what Dumbledore sends his great defender.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:49.29,2:22:52.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一只唱歌的鸟和一顶破帽子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A songbird and an old hat.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:06.27,2:23:10.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就让伏地魔大人，萨拉查·斯莱特林的继承人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's match the power of Lord Voldemort, Heir of Salazar Slytherin...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:10.98,2:23:14.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……来会会大名鼎鼎的哈利·波特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...against the famous Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:28.33,2:23:32.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蛇佬腔现在救不了你，波特。它只听我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Parseltongue won't save you now, Potter. It only obeys me.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:02.87,2:24:04.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:04.87,2:24:09.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的鸟也许弄瞎了蛇怪，但它还听得见你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your bird may have blinded the basilisk, but it can still hear you.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:51.39,2:25:54.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，波特。过程快完成了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, Potter. The process is nearly complete.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:54.85,2:25:59.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再过几分钟，金妮·韦斯莱就会死，我也不再只是一段记忆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In a few minutes, Ginny Weasley will be dead, and I will cease to be a memory.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:59.90,2:26:02.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伏地魔大人将会归来……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lord Voldemort will return...
Dialogue: 0,2:26:02.95,2:26:07.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……活生生地归来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...very much alive.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:07.91,2:26:09.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金妮？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ginny?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:25.63,2:28:27.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真了不起，不是吗……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remarkable, isn't it...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:27.38,2:28:31.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……蛇怪的毒液渗进身体有多快？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... how quickly the venom of the basilisk penetrates the body?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:31.55,2:28:34.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜你活不过一分钟了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd guess you have little more than a minute to live.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:34.56,2:28:38.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你很快就能去陪你亲爱的泥巴种妈妈了，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll be with your dear Mudblood mother soon, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:43.61,2:28:47.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真有意思，一本傻乎乎的小书能造成多大伤害……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Funny, the damage a silly little book can do...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:47.44,2:28:52.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……尤其是在一个傻乎乎的小姑娘手里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...especially in the hands of a silly little girl.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:55.33,2:28:57.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:29:00.04,2:29:02.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手。不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop. No!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:54.80,2:29:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金妮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:58.47,2:30:00.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:00.39,2:30:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我干的。但我发誓，我不是故意的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was me. But I swear, I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:04.60,2:30:08.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是里德尔逼我的，还有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Riddle made me, and....
Dialogue: 0,2:30:08.61,2:30:11.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，你受伤了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry, you're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:11.61,2:30:13.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:13.24,2:30:16.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金妮，你得赶紧出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ginny, you need to get yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:17.12,2:30:20.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}顺着密室走，你就能找到罗恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Follow the Chamber and you'll find Ron.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:32.51,2:30:34.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太棒了，福克斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were brilliant, Fawkes.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:35.72,2:30:38.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是我不够快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just wasn't quick enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:58.95,2:31:00.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:00.95,2:31:03.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凤凰的眼泪有治愈的力量。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Phoenix tears have healing powers.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:05.42,2:31:07.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:08.96,2:31:11.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事了，金妮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all right, Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:12.21,2:31:14.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:15.42,2:31:17.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那只是一段记忆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just a memory.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:20.89,2:31:26.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太神奇了！简直像魔法一样！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Amazing! This is just like magic!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:37.49,2:31:40.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩当然明白……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You both realize, of course...
Dialogue: 0,2:31:40.32,2:31:45.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……在过去几个小时里，你们大概违反了十几条校规。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that in the past few hours, you have broken perhaps a dozen school rules.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:46.46,2:31:47.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:47.71,2:31:50.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}证据充分，足以把你们俩开除。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is sufficient evidence to have you both expelled.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:51.08,2:31:52.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是的，先生。  -是的，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes, Sir.   -Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:52.42,2:31:55.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因此，最恰当的做法是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Therefore, it is only fitting...
Dialogue: 0,2:31:56.76,2:31:59.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……给你们俩颁发……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that you both receive...
Dialogue: 0,2:31:59.51,2:32:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……为学校做出特殊贡献奖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...9pecial Awards for Services to the School.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:05.72,2:32:07.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:08.10,2:32:10.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，韦斯莱先生，请你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, Mr. Weasley, if you would...
Dialogue: 0,2:32:10.60,2:32:14.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……派只猫头鹰把这些释放令送到阿兹卡班。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...nave an owl deliver these release papers to Azkaban.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:15.86,2:32:20.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我们该把猎场看守接回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I believe we want our gamekeeper back.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:23.33,2:32:25.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:25.62,2:32:29.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首先，我要谢谢你，哈利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First, I want to thank you, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:30.54,2:32:34.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在密室里一定对我表现出了真正的忠诚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You must have shown me real loyalty down in the Chamber.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:34.96,2:32:39.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除此之外，什么都不能把福克斯召唤到你身边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing but that could have called Fawkes to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:41.89,2:32:43.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And...
Dialogue: 0,2:32:44.01,2:32:45.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……其次……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...S@Cond...
Dialogue: 0,2:32:45.64,2:32:50.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我感觉到有些事在困扰你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I sense that something is troubling you.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:50.64,2:32:53.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说得对吗，哈利？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Am I right, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:54.98,2:32:56.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,2:32:57.86,2:33:02.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}您看，先生，我忍不住注意到一些事，一些……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see, sir, I couldn't help but notice certain things, certain....
Dialogue: 0,2:33:02.78,2:33:08.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汤姆·里德尔和我之间的一些相似之处。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Certain similarities between Tom Riddle and me.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:09.00,2:33:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:10.33,2:33:16.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会说蛇佬腔，哈利。为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you can speak Parseltongue, Harry. Why?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:16.59,2:33:22.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为伏地魔大人会说蛇佬腔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because Lord Voldemort can speak Parseltongue.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:23.34,2:33:26.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我没弄错，哈利……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I'm not mistaken, Harry...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:26.43,2:33:30.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……他把一部分法力传给了你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...he transferred some of his powers to you...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:30.43,2:33:33.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……就在他给你留下伤疤的那晚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the night he gave you that scar.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:33.56,2:33:37.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伏地魔把一部分法力传给了我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Voldemort transferred some of his powers to me?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:37.69,2:33:39.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:39.36,2:33:42.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是有意的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not intentionally...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:42.95,2:33:44.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但确实是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...but yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:46.83,2:33:50.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以分院帽说得对。我该进斯莱特林。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So the Sorting Hat was right. I should be in Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:50.33,2:33:55.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。你具有伏地魔本人看重的许多品质。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's true. You possess many of the qualities that Voldemort himself prizes.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:55.33,2:33:58.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}决心、足智多谋……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Determination, resourcefulness...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:58.34,2:34:02.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……还有，恕我直言，某种对规则的漠视。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..and if I may say so, a certain disregard for the rules.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:03.05,2:34:07.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，分院帽为什么把你分到了格兰芬多？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why, then, did the Sorting Hat place you in Gryffindor?
Dialogue: 0,2:34:07.89,2:34:11.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-因为我要求的。  -正是如此，哈利。正是如此。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Because I asked it to.   -Exactly, Harry. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:11.73,2:34:13.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这正是你和伏地魔不同的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which makes you different from Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:13.94,2:34:17.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}决定我们是什么样的人，不是我们的能力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is not our abilities that show what we truly are.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:18.11,2:34:20.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而是我们的选择。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is our choices.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:23.91,2:34:27.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你想知道自己为什么属于格兰芬多……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want proof why you belong in Gryffindor...
Dialogue: 0,2:34:27.49,2:34:32.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……那我建议你仔细看看这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...then I suggest you look more closely at this.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:33.41,2:34:35.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:40.75,2:34:43.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}戈德里克·格兰芬多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Godric Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:43.59,2:34:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有真正的格兰芬多人才能从帽子里抽出这把剑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It would take a true Gryffindor to pull that out of the hat.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:56.52,2:34:57.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:59.19,2:35:03.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原来这就是你的主人。你服侍的是马尔福家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So this is your master. The family you serve is the Malfoys.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:05.78,2:35:09.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我待会儿再收拾你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll deal with you later.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:14.96,2:35:16.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让开，波特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Out of my way, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:16.71,2:35:20.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来是真的。你回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So it's true. You have returned.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:20.96,2:35:23.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当校董们得知亚瑟·韦斯莱的女儿……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When the governors learned that Arthur Weasley's daughter...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:23.96,2:35:28.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……被带进了密室，他们觉得应该把我召回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...was taken into the Chamber, they saw fit to summon me back.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:28.97,2:35:30.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}荒唐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:30.47,2:35:32.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奇怪的是，卢修斯，他们中有几个人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Curiously, Lucius, several of them...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:33.18,2:35:36.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……以为你会诅咒他们的家人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...were under the impression that you would curse their families...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:37.02,2:35:39.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……如果他们一开始不同意暂停我的职务。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...lf they did not agree to suspend me in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:40.31,2:35:43.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你好大的胆子！  -你说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How dare you!   -Beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:43.98,2:35:47.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我唯一关心的，过去是，将来也永远是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My sole concern has always been and will always be...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:47.95,2:35:50.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……这所学校的福祉……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...the welfare of this school...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:50.95,2:35:55.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……当然，还有它的学生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and, of course, its students.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:59.25,2:36:03.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想，罪魁祸首已经查出来了吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The culprit has been identified, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:03.84,2:36:05.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:07.01,2:36:08.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:10.01,2:36:12.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:18.48,2:36:21.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-伏地魔。  -啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Voldemort.   -Ah.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:22.19,2:36:27.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只不过这次他选择通过别人来行动……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only this time he chose to act through somebody else...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:28.20,2:36:31.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……通过这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...by means of this.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:34.49,2:36:36.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:37.50,2:36:41.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}幸运的是，我们年轻的波特先生发现了它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fortunately, our young Mr. Potter discovered it.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:42.04,2:36:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但愿伏地魔阁下的旧日遗物……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One hopes that no more of Lord Voldemort's old school-things...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:45.88,2:36:49.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……不要再落到无辜的人手里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}... should find their way into innocent hands.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:49.42,2:36:53.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对责任人来说，后果将会……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The consequences for the one responsible would be...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:53.72,2:36:55.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……非常严重。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..S6VEre.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:57.06,2:36:59.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，但愿……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, let us hope...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:00.02,2:37:05.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……波特先生总能及时出现，拯救大家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that Mr. Potter will always be around to save the day.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:06.28,2:37:10.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心，我会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry. I will be.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:18.79,2:37:20.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邓布利多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:21.96,2:37:25.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，多比。我们走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come, Dobby. We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:42.77,2:37:47.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生？不知能不能把那个给我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir? I wonder if I could have that?
Dialogue: 0,2:37:53.66,2:37:55.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马尔福先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:55.45,2:37:57.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马尔福先生！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Malfoy!
Dialogue: 0,2:37:58.12,2:38:00.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有件你的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have something of yours.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:01.96,2:38:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的？我不知道你在说什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mine? I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:05.08,2:38:06.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我想你知道，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I think you do, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:06.79,2:38:09.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想是你把那本日记塞进金妮·韦斯莱的坩埚里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you slipped the diary into Ginny Weasley's cauldron...
Dialogue: 0,2:38:10.09,2:38:11.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……那天在对角巷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...that day at Diagon Alley.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:12.17,2:38:14.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗，你知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You do, do you?
Dialogue: 0,2:38:22.10,2:38:25.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你倒是证明给我看啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you prove it?
Dialogue: 0,2:38:31.40,2:38:33.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，多比。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come, Dobby.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:34.86,2:38:36.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打开它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open it.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:40.41,2:38:42.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:42.16,2:38:45.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}主人给了多比一只袜子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Master has given Dobby a sock.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:45.62,2:38:47.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？我没给——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? I didn't give--
Dialogue: 0,2:38:47.83,2:38:51.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}主人给了多比衣服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Master has presented Dobby with clothes.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:51.71,2:38:54.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多比自由了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dobby is free.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:01.35,2:39:05.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让我失去了我的仆人！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You lost me my servant!
Dialogue: 0,2:39:12.03,2:39:16.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不许伤害哈利·波特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You shall not harm Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:25.08,2:39:26.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hm.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:28.21,2:39:31.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你父母也是爱管闲事的蠢货。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your parents were meddlesome fools too.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:32.05,2:39:35.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住我的话，波特。很快有一天……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mark my words, Potter. One day soon...
Dialogue: 0,2:39:35.38,2:39:40.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……你也会落得同样的下场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...yOu are going to meet the same sticky end.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:46.31,2:39:52.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利·波特解放了多比。多比该怎么报答他呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry Potter freed Dobby. How can Dobby ever repay him?
Dialogue: 0,2:39:52.57,2:39:56.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-答应我一件事就好。  -什么都行，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Just promise me something.   -Anything, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:58.78,2:40:01.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再也别想救我命了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never try to save my life again.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:07.41,2:40:10.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎回来，尼古拉斯爵士。-谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Welcome back, Sir Nicholas.   -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:10.71,2:40:13.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚上好，尼古拉斯爵士。-晚上好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good evening, Sir Nicholas.   -Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:13.25,2:40:16.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴见到你，尼古拉斯爵士。-谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good to see you, Sir Nicholas.   -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:17.51,2:40:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:21.43,2:40:26.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-赫敏！欢迎回来。  -谢谢，尼古拉斯爵士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hermione! Welcome back.   -Thanks, Sir Nicholas.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:29.31,2:40:32.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利，是赫敏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry. It's Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:54.00,2:40:58.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，嗯，咳咳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, um, ahem.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:59.47,2:41:03.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-欢迎回来，赫敏。  -回来真好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Welcome back, Hermione.   -It's good to be back.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:03.34,2:41:05.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恭喜你。真不敢相信你解开了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Congratulations. I can't believe you solved it.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:06.14,2:41:08.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你帮了我们大忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We had loads of help from you.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:08.52,2:41:11.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-没有你我们做不到。  -谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We couldn't have done it without you.   -Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:13.56,2:41:16.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请大家注意一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could I have your attention, please?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:20.70,2:41:23.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在宴会开始之前……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Before we begin the feast...
Dialogue: 0,2:41:23.36,2:41:29.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……让我们为斯普劳特教授、庞弗雷夫人鼓掌……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...let us have a round of applause for Professor Sprout, Madam Pomfrey...
Dialogue: 0,2:41:29.83,2:41:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……她们的曼德拉草汁被成功地灌给了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...whose Mandrake juice has been so successfully administered...
Dialogue: 0,2:41:34.08,2:41:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……所有被石化的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to all who had been Petrified.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:47.31,2:41:50.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}另外，鉴于最近发生的事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Also, in light of the recent events...
Dialogue: 0,2:41:50.43,2:41:52.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……作为学校的特别款待……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...as a school treat...
Dialogue: 0,2:41:52.81,2:41:56.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……所有考试都取消了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...all exams have been canceled.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:59.40,2:42:01.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:17.92,2:42:19.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉我来晚了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:26.05,2:42:30.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}送释放证明的猫头鹰迷了路，晕头转向。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The owl that delivered my release papers got all lost and confused.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:30.77,2:42:34.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一只叫埃罗尔的笨鸟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some ruddy bird called Errol.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:49.87,2:42:55.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想说，要不是你，哈利，还有罗恩……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'd just like to say that if it hadn't been for you, Harry, and Ron...
Dialogue: 0,2:42:56.08,2:42:59.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……当然，还有赫敏……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and Hermione, of course...
Dialogue: 0,2:42:59.67,2:43:03.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……我现在还在那个不能说的地方……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...I would still be you-know-where...
Dialogue: 0,2:43:03.92,2:43:07.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……所以我只想说声谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...SO I'd just like to say thanks.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:16.94,2:43:19.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有你，就没有霍格沃茨，海格。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no Hogwarts without you, Hagrid.
